<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Atemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Atemmufoɔ Nwoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Atemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ate</para>
  <para style="mt1">Atemmufoɔ Nwoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ne Simeon Fa Asase No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1"/>Yosua wuo akyi no, Israelfoɔ bisaa Awurade sɛ, “Abusuakuo bɛn na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkɔto hyɛ Kanaanfoɔ no so kane?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2"/>Awurade buaa sɛ, “Yuda na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkɔ; mede asase no so die ahyɛ wɔn nsam.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3"/>Enti, Yuda ntuanofoɔ ka kyerɛɛ wɔn nuanom Simeon abusuakuo no sɛ, “Mommɛka yɛn ho na yɛnko ntia Kanaanfoɔ a wɔte asase a wɔde ama yɛn no so. Yɛn nso, yɛbɛboa mo ama moako afa mo asase.” Enti, Simeonfoɔ mmarima no ne Yudafoɔ no kɔeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4"/>Ɛberɛ a Yuda kɔɔ wɔn so no, Awurade ma wɔdii Kanaanfoɔ ne Perisifoɔ no so nkonim, na wɔkunkumm atamfoɔ akofoɔ ɔpedu wɔ Besek. <verse eid="JDG 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5"/>Besek hɔ, wɔne ɔhene Adoni-Besek hyiaeɛ, na wɔko tiaa no, dii Kanaanfoɔ no ne Perisifoɔ no so nkonim. <verse eid="JDG 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6"/>Adoni-Besek dwaneeɛ, nanso ankyɛre na Israelfoɔ kɔkyeree no twitwaa ne nsa ne ne nan kokurobetie.<verse eid="JDG 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7"/>Ɛmaa Adoni-Besek kaa sɛ, “Ɛberɛ bi na mewɔ Ahemfo aduɔson a wɔatwitwa wɔn kokurobetie bɛtasee mporoporowa wɔ me didipono ase. Afei, Awurade atua me deɛ meyɛɛ wɔn no so ka.” Wɔde no kɔɔ Yerusalem na ɔwuu wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="JDG 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8"/>Yuda mmarima no to hyɛɛ Yerusalem so, dii so nkonim. Wɔkunkumm kuropɔn no so nnipa nyinaa, too mu ogya.<verse eid="JDG 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9"/>Ɛno akyi, wɔdane faa anafoɔ fam, kɔto hyɛɛ Kanaanfoɔ a wɔtete bepɔ asase, Negeb ne atɔeɛ fam nkokoɔ so no so. <verse eid="JDG 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10"/>Yuda bɔ wuraa Kanaanfoɔ a na wɔte Hebron a kane no na wɔfrɛ hɔ Kiriat-Arba no mu, dii Sesai, Ahiman ne Talmai so. <verse eid="JDG 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11"/>Wɔfiri hɔ kɔtoaa nnipa a wɔte Debir a kane no na wɔfrɛ hɔ (Kiriat-Sefer no).<verse eid="JDG 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12"/>Na Kaleb kaa sɛ, “Obiara a ɔbɛto ahyɛ Kiriat-Sefer so na wafa no, mede me babaa Aksa bɛma no aware.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13"/>Ɛnna Kaleb nua kumaa Kenas babarima Otniel kɔfaeɛ. Enti, Aksa bɛyɛɛ Otniel yere.<verse eid="JDG 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14"/>Aksa waree Otniel no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔmmisa nʼagya Kaleb na ɔmma wɔn asase nka deɛ wɔwɔ no ho. Ɔfiri nʼafunumu so sii fam ara pɛ, Kaleb bisaa no sɛ, “Asɛm bɛn? Ɛdeɛn na menyɛ mma wo?”<verse eid="JDG 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15"/>Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Ma me nhyira bio. Woadom me ama me asase wɔ Negeb, na mesrɛ wo ma me asase a nsuo wɔ so.” Enti, Kaleb maa no atifi ne anafoɔ fam nsuwansuwa asase.<verse eid="JDG 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16"/>Ɛberɛ a Yuda abusuakuo firii Yeriko no, Kenifoɔ a wɔyɛ Mose ase barima asefoɔ ne wɔn kɔɔ Yuda ɛserɛ no so. Wɔtenaa nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no mu wɔ beaeɛ bi a ɛbɛn Arad a ɛwɔ Negeb.<verse eid="JDG 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17"/>Afei, Yuda ne Simeon ka bɔɔ mu ko tiaa Kanaanfoɔ a wɔte Sefat no sɛee kuro no pasaa. Enti, wɔtoo kuro no edin Horma. <verse eid="JDG 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18"/>Ɛno akyi, Yuda ko faa nkuropɔn Gasa, Askelon ne Ekron ne wɔn nsase a atwa wɔn ho ahyia.<verse eid="JDG 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Antumi Amfa Asase No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19"/>Na Awurade ka Yuda nkurɔfoɔ ho enti, ɛmaa wɔfaa bepɔ nsase no. Nanso, wɔantumi ampam nnipa a wɔte tata so no amfiri hɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔwɔ nnadeɛ nteaseɛnam. <verse eid="JDG 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20"/>Wɔde Hebron kuropɔn maa Kaleb sɛdeɛ na Mose ahyɛ ho bɔ no. Na Kaleb pamoo nnipa a na wɔyɛ Anak mmammarima baasa no asefoɔ no firii hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21"/>Benyamin abusuakuo no antumi ampam Yebusifoɔ a na wɔte Yerusalem no. Enti, ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ yi, Yebusifoɔ ne Benyamin nkurɔfoɔ da so te Yerusalem.<verse eid="JDG 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22"/>Yosef asefoɔ kɔto hyɛɛ Bet-El kuro no so, na Awurade kaa wɔn ho. <verse eid="JDG 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23"/>Wɔsomaa akwansrafoɔ kɔɔ Bet-El (a kane no na wɔfrɛ no Lus) hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24"/>Wɔde nsɛmmisa puapuaa ɔbarima bi a na ɔfiri kuropɔn no mu reba. Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Kyerɛ yɛn ɛkwan a wɔde kɔ kuropɔn no mu na yɛn nso, yɛbɛhunu wo mmɔbɔ.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25"/>Enti, ɔkyerɛɛ wɔn kuropɔn no kwan ma wɔkɔkunkumm kuropɔn no mu nnipa nyinaa, na wɔgyaa ɔbarima no ne nʼabusuafoɔ. <verse eid="JDG 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26"/>Akyire no, ɔbarima no tutu kɔɔ Hetifoɔ asase so. Ɔkyekyeree kuropɔn wɔ hɔ. Ɔtoo kuropɔn no edin Lus. Na saa edin no da kuropɔn no so de bɛsi ɛnnɛ.<verse eid="JDG 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27"/>Manase abusuakuo no nso antumi ampam nnipa a na wɔte Bet-Sean, Taanak, Dor, Yibleam, Megido ne wɔn nkuraaseɛ no, ɛfiri sɛ, na Kanaanfoɔ no aka sɛ, sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ biara, ɛhɔ ara na wɔpɛ sɛ wɔtena. <verse eid="JDG 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28"/>Israelfoɔ no nyaa ahoɔden kakra no, wɔhyɛɛ Kanaanfoɔ no ma wɔyɛɛ nnwuma sɛ nkoa maa wɔn a wɔampamo wɔn amfiri asase no so. <verse eid="JDG 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29"/>Efraim abusuakuo no nso antumi antu Kanaanfoɔ a na wɔte Geser no enti Kanaanfoɔ no kɔɔ so ne wɔn tenaeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30"/>Sebulon abusuakuo no antumi antu Kanaanfoɔ a na wɔte Kitron ne Nahalol, enti wɔkɔɔ so ne wɔn tenaeɛ. Nanso, wɔhyɛɛ wɔn ma wɔyɛɛ adwuma sɛ nkoa. <verse eid="JDG 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31"/>Aser abusuakuo no nso antumi antu wɔn a na wɔte Ako, Sidon, Ahlab, Aksib, Helba, Afik ne Rehob. <verse eid="JDG 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32"/>Nokorɛm, ɛsiane sɛ wɔantumi antu wɔn no enti, Kanaanfoɔ no dɔɔso wɔ asase a Aserfoɔ no te soɔ no so. <verse eid="JDG 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33"/>Naftali abusuakuo no nso antumi antu wɔn a na wɔte Bet-Semes ne Bet-Anat. Mmom, Kanaanfoɔ no dɔɔso wɔ asase a wɔte soɔ no so. Nanso wɔhyɛɛ nnipa a wɔte Bet-Semes ne Bet-Anat ma wɔyɛɛ adwuma sɛ nkoa maa Naftali nkurɔfoɔ. <verse eid="JDG 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34"/>Dan abusuakuo no deɛ, Amorifoɔ hyɛɛ wɔn maa wɔtu kɔɔ bepɔ nsase no so na wɔamma wɔn amma tata so hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35"/>Amorifoɔ no sii wɔn adwene pi sɛ, wɔbɛtena Heres bepɔ so wɔ Ayalon ne Saalbim, nanso Yosef asefoɔ no yɛɛ den mmorosoɔ no, wɔhyɛɛ Amorifoɔ no ma wɔyɛɛ adwuma sɛ nkoa. <verse eid="JDG 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36"/>Na Amorifoɔ hyeɛ firi Akrabbim aforoeɛ kɔ Sela na ɛtoa so kɔ atifi fam.<verse eid="JDG 1:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Bɔfoɔ Ba Bokim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1"/>Na Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ firi Gilgal kɔɔ Bokim de nkra kɔmaa Israelfoɔ sɛ, “Meyii mo firii Misraim, de mo baa asase a mekaa ho ntam sɛ mede bɛma mo agyanom no so. Mekaa sɛ, Meremmu mʼapam a me ne mo ayɛ no so. <verse eid="JDG 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2"/>Mo fam deɛ ne sɛ, mo ne nnipa a wɔte asase yi so no nnyɛ apam biara na mmom mobɛsɛe wɔn afɔrebukyia nyinaa. Na adɛn enti na moanni me mmaransɛm so? <verse eid="JDG 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3"/>Deɛ moayɛ yi enti, merempam nnipa a wɔtete mo asase so no. Wɔbɛyɛ mo nkyɛnmu nkasɛɛ na wɔn anyame nso ayɛ mfidie ama mo.”<verse eid="JDG 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4"/>Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ kasa wieeɛ no Israelfoɔ no suu denden. <verse eid="JDG 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5"/>Enti wɔtoo beaeɛ hɔ edin “Agyaadwotwa”. Na wɔbɔɔ afɔdeɛ wɔ hɔ maa Awurade.<verse eid="JDG 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Owuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6"/>Yosua gyaa nkurɔfoɔ no kwan akyi no, mmusuakuo no mu biara kɔfaa nʼagyapadeɛ a wɔde maa no sɛ ne kyɛfa no. <verse eid="JDG 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7"/>Na Israelfoɔ no somm Awurade wɔ Yosua ne mpanimfoɔ a wɔanyini sene Yosua a wɔhunuu nneɛma akɛseɛ a Awurade yɛ maa Israel, Yosua nkwa nna nyinaa mu no.<verse eid="JDG 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8"/>Afei, Nun babarima Yosua, Awurade ɔsomfoɔ wuiɛ a na wadi mfirinhyia ɔha ne edu. <verse eid="JDG 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9"/>Wɔsiee no wɔ nʼawunya asase a na ɛwɔ Timnat-Heres, Efraim bepɔ asase no a ɛwɔ Gaas bepɔ no atifi fam no.<verse eid="JDG 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israelfoɔ Yɛ Asoɔden Tia <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10"/>Saa awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ no akyi no, awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ foforɔ nyiniiɛ a na wɔnnim <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na wɔnkae nneɛma akɛseɛ a wayɛ ama Israel. <verse eid="JDG 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11"/>Na Israelfoɔ no yɛɛ deɛ ɛnyɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so, na wɔsom Baalim ahoni. <verse eid="JDG 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12"/>Wɔgyaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn agyanom Onyankopɔn a ɔyii wɔn firii Misraim no. Wɔdii anyame foforɔ akyi, somm saa anyame no a ɛyɛ nnipa a wɔatwa wɔn ho ahyia no dea. Na wɔmaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuiɛ. <verse eid="JDG 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13"/>Wɔgyaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyi die, kɔsom Baalim ne Astoret ahoni. <verse eid="JDG 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14"/>Yei maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu Israel, enti ɔde wɔn hyɛɛ afomfafoɔ nsa, ma wɔwiaa wɔn ahodeɛ. Ɔtɔn wɔn maa wɔn atamfoɔ a wɔatwa wɔn ho ahyia, na wɔantumi annyina wɔn ano. <verse eid="JDG 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15"/>Ɛberɛ biara a Israelfoɔ bɛkɔ ɔko no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ko tia wɔn ma wɔdi nkoguo, sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ bɔ no. Enti, wɔn ho hiahiaa wɔn papaapa.<verse eid="JDG 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Gye Ne Nkurɔfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pagyaa atemmufoɔ ma wɔbɛgyee Israelfoɔ firi wɔn atamfoɔ nsam. <verse eid="JDG 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17"/>Nanso, Israelfoɔ no antie atemmufoɔ no. Wɔkɔɔ so de wɔn ho bɔɔ anyame foforɔ, kotoo wɔn. Wɔtwee wɔn ho ntɛm so firii wɔn agyanom a wɔyɛɛ ɔsetie maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmaransɛm no kwan so. <verse eid="JDG 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18"/>Ɛberɛ biara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔtemmufoɔ bi bɛdua Israel so no, na ɔka saa ɔtemmufoɔ no ho na ɔgye nnipa no firi wɔn atamfoɔ no nsam wɔ saa ɔtemmufoɔ no nkwa nna nyinaa mu. Ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hunuu ne nkurɔfoɔ a wɔredi wɔn nya na wɔrehunu amane no mmɔbɔ. <verse eid="JDG 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19"/>Nanso, atemmufoɔ no wuo akyi no, nnipa no sane kɔɔ wɔn bra bɔne no mu a, afei na wɔasɛesɛe sene wɔn a wɔdii wɔn anim ɛkan no. Wɔdii anyame foforɔ akyi. Wɔkotoo wɔn, somm wɔn. Na wɔampɛ sɛ wɔgyae wɔn nnebɔnesɛm ne kɔnseneeɛsɛm no.<verse eid="JDG 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20"/>Enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu Israel. Ɔkaa sɛ, “Esiane sɛ saa nnipa yi abu apam a me ne wɔn agyanom yɛeɛ so, na wɔapo me mmaransɛm enti, <verse eid="JDG 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21"/>merempamo aman a Yosua anni wɔn so ansa na ɔrewuo no. <verse eid="JDG 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22"/>Meyɛɛ yei de sɔɔ Israel hwɛeɛ sɛ wɔbɛtie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛdeɛ wɔn agyanom yɛeɛ no.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23"/>Ɛno enti na amma Awurade ampam aman no ntɛm so na wamma Yosua ammɛdi wɔn nyinaa so no.<verse eid="JDG 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Aman A Wɔkaa Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1"/>Awurade gyaa aman bi wɔ asase no so a na ɔnam so pɛ sɛ ɔsɔ Israelfoɔ a wɔnkɔɔ Kanaan ko no bi da hwɛ. <verse eid="JDG 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2"/>Ɔyɛɛ saa de kyerɛɛ Israel nkyirimma a wɔnkɔɔ ɔko da no sɛdeɛ wɔbɛnya akodie ho nimdeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3"/>Saa aman no nie: Filistifoɔ (wɔn a na wɔhyɛ Filistifoɔ ahemfo baanum bi ase no), Kanaanfoɔ nyinaa, Sidonfoɔ, Hewifoɔ a na wɔte Lebanon bepɔ no so firi Baal Hermon bepɔ ho de kɔsi Lebo Hamat. <verse eid="JDG 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4"/>Wɔgyaa saa nkurɔfoɔ yi de sɔɔ Israelfoɔ no hwɛeɛ, pɛɛ sɛ wɔhunu sɛ wɔbɛdi mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so hyɛ maa wɔn agyanom no so anaa.<verse eid="JDG 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5"/>Enti, Israelfoɔ no tenaa Kanaanfoɔ, Hetifoɔ, Amorifoɔ, Perisifoɔ, Hewifoɔ ne Yebusifoɔ no mu. <verse eid="JDG 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6"/>Na wɔdii wɔn ho awadeɛ. Israelfoɔ mmammarima no warewaree wɔn mmammaa ɛnna wɔde Israelfoɔ mmammaa nso maa wɔn mmammarima awadeɛ. Na Israelfoɔ no somm wɔn anyame.<verse eid="JDG 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otniel Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtɛmmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7"/>Israelfoɔ no yɛɛ deɛ ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so bɔne. Wɔn werɛ firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn Onyankopɔn, na wɔsomm Baalim ahoni ne Asera afɔrebukyia. <verse eid="JDG 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo mu yɛɛ den tiaa Israel enti, ɔde wɔn hyɛɛ Aramhene Kusan-Risataim nsam. Na Israelfoɔ yɛɛ Kusan-Risataim nkoa mfirinhyia nwɔtwe.<verse eid="JDG 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9"/>Nanso, Israelfoɔ su frɛɛ Awurade no, ɔyii ɔbarima bi sɛ ɔgyefoɔ maa wɔn. Ne din ne Otniel a ɔyɛ Kaleb nua kumaa Kenas babarima. <verse eid="JDG 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> honhom baa ne so, enti ɔbɛyɛɛ Israel ɔtemmufoɔ. Ɔko tiaa Aramhene Kusan-Risataim na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa Otniel dii ne so nkonim. <verse eid="JDG 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11"/>Enti, asomdwoeɛ baa asase no so mfirinhyia aduanan. Na Kenas babarima Otniel wuiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehud Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12"/>Bio, Israelfoɔ no yɛɛ deɛ ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so bɔne, na ɛno enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de tumi hyɛɛ Moabhene Eglon nsa ma ɔdii Israel so. <verse eid="JDG 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13"/>Eglon boaboaa Amonfoɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Amonfoɔ yɛ Lot asefoɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:38">1 Mose 19.38</ref></char>). Na Amalekfoɔ nso yɛ Esau asefoɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 36:12">1 Mose 36.12</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 36:16">16</ref></char>). Na wɔbɛn Israel, nanso na wɔyɛ Israelfoɔ atamfoɔ kɛseɛ.</char></note> ne Amalekfoɔ ano ma wɔbɛkaa ne ho na wɔkɔto hyɛɛ Israelfoɔ so. Wɔdii wɔn so, faa kuropɔn Yeriko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14"/>Israelfoɔ no somm Moabhene Eglon mfirinhyia dunwɔtwe.<verse eid="JDG 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15"/>Nanso Israelfoɔ no su frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bio no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa wɔn ɔgyefoɔ. Ne din ne Ehud, Gera babarima a ɔyɛ abenkumma na ɔfiri Benyamin abusuakuo mu. Israelfoɔ no somaa Ehud sɛ ɔmfa wɔn apeatoɔ sika nkɔma Moabhene Eglon. <verse eid="JDG 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16"/>Enti, Ehud bɔɔ sekan anofanu a ne tenten yɛ nsateakwaa dunwɔtwe. Ɔde hyɛɛ ne srɛ nifa ho de siee nʼatadeɛ mu. <verse eid="JDG 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17"/>Ɔde apeatoɔ sika no brɛɛ Eglon a wayɛ kɛse twɔfee no. <verse eid="JDG 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18"/>Ɔde sika no maa no wieeɛ no, Ehud gyaa wɔn a na wɔso sika no kwan ma wɔkɔɔ fie. <verse eid="JDG 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a Ehud duruu aboɔ ahoni a ɛbɛn Gilgal no, ɔsane nʼakyi baa Eglon nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Mewɔ kokoamsɛm bi meka kyerɛ wo.” Enti ɔhene no maa nʼasomfoɔ no nyinaa yɛɛ dinn na ɔmaa wɔn nyinaa firii ɛdan mu hɔ.<verse eid="JDG 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20"/>Afei, Ehud kɔɔ Eglon nkyɛn. Na ɔte aborɔsan dan bi a emu dwoɔ mu. Ehud ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Mewɔ asɛm bi a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn ka kyerɛ wo!” Ɛberɛ a ɔhene Eglon sɔre firii nʼakonnwa mu ara pɛ, <verse eid="JDG 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21"/>Ehud de ne nsa benkum twee sekan a ɔde ahyɛ ne srɛ nifa ho no de wɔɔ ɔhene no yafunu mu. <verse eid="JDG 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22"/>Sekan no kɔɔ akyiri kɔsii sɛ nʼabona no mpo wuraa ɔhene no sradeɛ mu maa ɛso kataeɛ. Enti, Ehud gyaa sekan no wɔ yafunu no mu maa ne nsono tu guiɛ. <verse eid="JDG 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23"/>Afei, Ehud totoo apono no mu foroo agyanan dan no, faa ne nsuseneeɛ no mu dwane kɔeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24"/>Ehud kɔeɛ akyi no, ɔhene asomfoɔ no baa hɔ bɛhunuu sɛ, apono a ɛkɔ aborɔsan no so no, wɔatoto mu. Na wɔdwene sɛ ɔwɔ agyananbea hɔ, <verse eid="JDG 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25"/>enti, wɔtwɛneeɛ. Wɔtwɛneeɛ ara na ɔhene no mma no, ɛhaa wɔn ma wɔkɔpɛɛ safoa bi. Na wɔbuee ɛpono no, wɔhunuu sɛ wɔn wura awu da fam.<verse eid="JDG 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26"/>Ɛberɛ a asomfoɔ no retwɛn no, Ehud dwane faa aboɔ ahoni no so a ɔrekɔ Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27"/>Ɔduruu Efraim bepɔ asase no so no, Ehud hyɛnee totorobɛnto kyerɛɛ ɔman no sɛ wɔmfa akodeɛ mmra. Enti, ɔdii Israelfoɔ kuo bi anim sianee bepɔ no.<verse eid="JDG 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monni mʼakyi. Awurade ama moadi Moabfoɔ a wɔyɛ mo atamfoɔ no so nkonim.” Enti, wɔtu dii nʼakyi. Israelfoɔ no faa asubɔnten Yordan baabi a ɛhɔ nnɔ a wɔfiri Moab tware. Ɛno enti na obiara ntumi mfa hɔ ntwa Asubɔnten no. <verse eid="JDG 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29"/>Wɔto hyɛɛ Moabfoɔ no so. Wɔkunkumm wɔn nnɔmmarima no bɛyɛ ɔpedu. Wɔn mu biara antumi annwane. <verse eid="JDG 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30"/>Enti, Israelfoɔ dii Moabfoɔ so nkonim saa ɛda no, na asomdwoeɛ baa asase no so mfirinhyia aduɔwɔtwe.<verse eid="JDG 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samgar Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31"/>Ehud akyi no, Anat babarima Samgar gyee Israelfoɔ. Ɔde nantwika abaa kumm Filistifoɔ aha nsia.<verse eid="JDG 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Debora Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1"/>Ehud wuo akyi no, Israelfoɔ no yɛɛ bɔne wɔ Awurade ani so bio. <verse eid="JDG 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2"/>Enti, Awurade de wɔn hyɛɛ Kanaanhene Yabin a na ɔdi adeɛ wɔ Hasor no nsa. Na ɔsahene a ɔtua nʼakodɔm ano no din de Sisera a na ɔte Haroset-Hagoyim. <verse eid="JDG 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3"/>Na Sisera wɔ nnadeɛ nteaseɛnam aha nkron, na ɔde atirimuɔden hyɛɛ Israelfoɔ no so mfirinhyia aduonu. Afei Israelfoɔ no su frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pɛɛ mmoa.<verse eid="JDG 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4"/>Debora a na ɔyɛ Lapidot yere ne odiyifoɔ baa na ɔbɛyɛɛ Israelfoɔ ɔtemmufoɔ. <verse eid="JDG 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5"/>Na ɔtenaa Debora Abɛ Dua ase a ɛwɔ Rama ne Bet-El ntam wɔ Efraim bepɔ asase no so. Ɛhɔ na na Israelfoɔ no kɔ ma ɔdi wɔn nsɛm. <verse eid="JDG 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6"/>Ɛda bi, ɔsoma ma wɔkɔfrɛɛ Abinoam babarima Barak a na ɔte Kedes wɔ Naftali asase so. Ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn hyɛ wo sɛ yɛ: Kɔboaboa akofoɔ ɔpedu ano firi Naftali ne Sebulon mmusuakuo mu wɔ Tabor bepɔ so hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7"/>Mɛdaadaa Yabin akodɔm sahene Sisera ne ne nteaseɛnam ne akofoɔ akɔ Asubɔnten Kison ho. Ɛhɔ na mɛma woadi ne so nkonim.”<verse eid="JDG 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8"/>Barak ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ wo ne me bɛkɔ dea, mɛkɔ!”<verse eid="JDG 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9"/>Debora buaa no sɛ, “Mate, me ne wo bɛkɔ, nanso worennya animuonyam biara wɔ dwumadie yi mu, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkonimdie wɔ Sisera so no bɛfiri ɔbaa nsam.” Enti, Debora ne Barak kɔɔ Kedes. <verse eid="JDG 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10"/>Kedes hɔ, Barak frɛfrɛɛ Sebulon abusuakuo ne Naftali abusuakuo mu nnipa nyinaa, na akofoɔ ɔpedu ne no kɔeɛ. Debora nso kaa wɔn ho kɔeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11"/>Na Kenini Heber atwe ne ho afiri Kenifoɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛfiri Mose berɛ so na Kenifoɔ ne Israelfoɔ yɛ baako (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:1">2 Mose 3.1</ref></char>). Ɛberɛ a wɔdi Kanaanfoɔ so no, wɔne Israelfoɔ na wɔko tiaa wɔn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 1:6">2 Ah 1.6</ref></char>).</char></note> a wɔyɛ Mose akonta Hobab asefoɔ no ho, akɔsi ne ntomadan wɔ dua kɛseɛ bi a ɛsi Saananim a ɛbɛn Kedes no ho.<verse eid="JDG 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔka kyerɛɛ Sisera sɛ Abinoam ba Barak aforo kɔ Tabor bepɔ so no, <verse eid="JDG 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13"/>ɔboaboaa ne nnadeɛ nteaseɛnam aha nkron ano ne nʼakofoɔ nyinaa, na wɔtu tene firii Haroset-Hagoyim kɔɔ Asubɔnten Kison ho.<verse eid="JDG 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14"/>Afei, Debora ka kyerɛɛ Barak sɛ, “Yɛ ahoboa! Ɛnnɛ ne ɛda a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de Sisera so nkonimdie bɛma wo, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atu sa adi wʼanim.” Enti, Barak dii nʼakodɔm ɔpedu anim sianee Tabor bepɔ no kɔkoeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15"/>Ɛberɛ a Barak to hyɛɛ wɔn so no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa huboa bɔɔ Sisera, ne nteaseɛnamkafoɔ ne nʼakofoɔ no nyinaa. Ɛbaa saa no, Sisera huri firii ne teaseɛnam mu sii fam dwaneeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16"/>Barak nteaseɛnam ne ɔtamfoɔ no akodɔm no ara kɔsii Haroset-Hagoyim, kunkumm Sisera akofoɔ no nyinaa. Anka wɔn mu baako mpo. <verse eid="JDG 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17"/>Sisera dwane kɔhyɛɛ Kenini Heber yere Yael ntomadan mu, ɛfiri sɛ, na Heber abusuafoɔ ne Hasorhene Yabin wɔ ayɔnkofa.<verse eid="JDG 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18"/>Yael firii adi kɔhyiaa Sisera ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, bra me ntomadan yi mu. Bra mu. Nsuro.” Enti, ɔkɔɔ ntomadan no mu maa ɔde nnasoɔ kataa ne so.<verse eid="JDG 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19"/>Sisera ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Mesrɛ wo, sukɔm de me enti ma me nsuo.” Enti ɔmaa no nufosuo sɛ ɔnnom, na ɔsane kataa ne so.<verse eid="JDG 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20"/>Sisera ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Gyina ntomadan no ano na sɛ obi bɛbisa wo sɛ obi wɔ ha a, ka sɛ dabi.”<verse eid="JDG 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21"/>Nanso, ɔbrɛ enti, Sisera faa mu daeɛ. Yael, a ɔyɛ Heber yere, yɛɛ brɛoo kɔɔ ne so. Ɔde hamre ne pɛɛwa na ɛkɔeɛ. Ɔde pɛɛwa no sii ne moma so de hama no bɔɔ so, kɔsii sɛ ɛhwiree ne moma mu sii fam ma ɔwuiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22"/>Ɛberɛ a Barak baa sɛ ɔrebɛhwehwɛ Sisera no, Yael pue bɛhyiaa no. Ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Bra na menkyerɛ wo ɔbarima a worehwehwɛ noɔ no.” Enti, ɔdii nʼakyi kɔɔ ntomadan no mu kɔhunuu Sisera sɛ wawu da hɔ a pɛɛwa si ne moma so.<verse eid="JDG 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23"/>Ɛda no na Israel hunuu sɛ Onyankopɔn adi Kanaanhene Yabin so nkonim. <verse eid="JDG 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24"/>Na ɛno akyi no, Israel nyaa ahoɔden tiaa ɔhene Yabin ara kɔsii sɛ akyire yi, wɔsɛee no.<verse eid="JDG 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Debora Dwom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1"/>Ɛda no, Debora ne Abinoam babarima Barak too saa dwom yi:<verse eid="JDG 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2"/>“Israel mpanimfoɔ sɔre dii animu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">na nnipa no de anigyeɛ dii wɔn akyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">Nhyira nka <char style="nd">Awurade</char>!<verse eid="JDG 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3"/>“Mo ahemfo, montie!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Monyɛ aso, mo aberempɔn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Na mɛto dwom ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Mɛma me nne so ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JDG 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ɛberɛ a wofirii Seir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">na wobɔɔ nsra faa Edom mfuo so no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">asase wosoeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">na ɔsoro omununkum tuee nsuo.<verse eid="JDG 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ba no maa mmepɔ wosoeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">Sinai Bepɔ mpo wosoeɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn anim.<verse eid="JDG 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6"/>“Anat ba Samgar ne Yael berɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">nnipa amfa akwantempɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">na akwantufoɔ faa anammɔnkwan kɔntɔnkye so.<verse eid="JDG 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7"/>Nnipa kakra na wɔkaa Israel nkuraaseɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">kɔsii sɛ Debora sɔree sɛ ɛna maa Israel.<verse eid="JDG 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8"/>Ɛberɛ a Israel somm anyame foforɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">ɔko sɔree kuropɔn no apono ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">Nanso wɔanhunu kyɛm anaa pea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">wɔ akofoɔ ɔpeduanan a wɔwɔ Israel mu!<verse eid="JDG 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9"/>Mewɔ Israel ntuanofoɔ afa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">ne wɔn a wɔde anigyeɛ dii wɔn akyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">Hyira <char style="nd">Awurade</char>!<verse eid="JDG 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10"/>“Mo a motete afunumu a wɔte apɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">tete nsaa a ɛyɛ fɛ so, montie!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">Ne mo a ɛsɛ sɛ monante fam nso, montie!<verse eid="JDG 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11"/>Montie nkuraaseɛ nnwomsiaafoɔ a wɔaboa wɔn ho ano wɔ anomeeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Wɔkeka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tenenee nkonimdie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">ne ne nkuraasefoɔ nkonimdie wɔ Israel ho asɛm.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">“Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkurɔfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">bɔɔ nsra kɔɔ kuropɔn no apono ano.<verse eid="JDG 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12"/>‘Sɔre! Debora, sɔre!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Sɔre, sɔre na to dwom!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Sɔre, Barak!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Di wo nneduafoɔ anim kɔ, Abinoam ba!’<verse eid="JDG 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13"/>“Nkaeɛfoɔ no bɔɔ nsra firi Tabor kɔɔ ahoɔdenfoɔ so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkurɔfoɔ bɔɔ nsra kɔɔ akofoɔ ahoɔdenfoɔ so.<verse eid="JDG 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14"/>Wɔfiri Efraim baeɛ, asase a na kane no na ɛyɛ Amalekfoɔ dea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">na Benyamin nso dii wʼakyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Asahene no bɔɔ nsra firii Makir;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">ɔsahene pomakurafoɔ firi Sebulon baeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15"/>Na Isakar mu atitire ka Debora ne Barak ho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">Wɔdii Barak akyi, bɔ wuraa bɔnhwa no mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Nanso, Ruben abusuakuo mu deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">wɔansi wɔn adwene pi.<verse eid="JDG 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16"/>Adɛn enti na wotenaa efie wɔ nnwanhwɛfoɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">tie nnwanhwɛfoɔ a wɔde hwerɛma frɛ wɔn nnwan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Ruben abusuakuo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">wɔansi wɔn adwene pi.<verse eid="JDG 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17"/>Gilead kaa Yordan apueeɛ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">Na Dan deɛ, adɛn enti na ɔtenaa fie?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Aser tenaa mpoano a wanka ne ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">ɔkaa nʼahyɛn gyinabea ahodoɔ hɔ.<verse eid="JDG 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18"/>Nanso, Sebulon too ne nkwa akyerɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:18">sɛdeɛ Naftali yɛɛ wɔ akono no.<verse eid="JDG 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19"/>“Kanaan ahemfo koeɛ wɔ Taanak a ɛbɛn Megido nsutire ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">nanso, wɔannya asadeɛ biara ankɔ.<verse eid="JDG 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20"/>Nsoromma firi soro koeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:20">Nsoromma nam wɔn kyenenee so ko tiaa Sisera.<verse eid="JDG 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21"/>Asubɔnten Kison twee wɔn kɔeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">tete asuo, Kison.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">Me kra, fa akokoɔduru bɔ nsra kɔ wʼanim!<verse eid="JDG 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22"/>Afei, apɔnkɔ no tɔte pempem fam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">wɔde mmirikatɛntɛ, Sisera apɔnkɔ ahoɔdenfoɔ no mmirikatɛntɛ.<verse eid="JDG 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23"/>‘Nnome nka Merosfoɔ,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">Ma nnome a ano yɛ den nka wɔn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">ɛfiri sɛ, wɔammɛboa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">wɔammɛboa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anko antia akofoɔ ahoɔdenfoɔ no.<verse eid="JDG 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24"/>“Nhyira nka Yael,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">Heber a ɔfiri Keni yere.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">Ne nhyira nsene mmaa a wɔtete ntomadan mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JDG 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25"/>Sisera srɛɛ nsuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">na Yael maa no nufosuo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:25">bonsua a ɛfata ahemfo no mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">na ɔde nufosuo ani sradeɛ brɛɛ no.<verse eid="JDG 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26"/>Afei, ɔde ne nsa benkum yii ntomadan pɛɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">na ɔde ne nsa nifa faa odwumfoɔ asaeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Ɔde bɔɔ Sisera, pɛkyɛɛ ne ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">Ɔde pɛɛwa no wɔɔ ne moma so, bɔɔ so kɔɔ ne tirim.<verse eid="JDG 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27"/>Ɔhodwoeɛ, ɔhwee ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">ɔwuu wɔ ne nan ase.<verse eid="JDG 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28"/>“Sisera nena hwɛɛ mpomma mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">ɔtɛɛ mpomma mu hwɛɛ no kwan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Adɛn enti na ne teaseɛnam akyɛre ba yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">Adɛn enti na yɛnte teaseɛnam nhankra nnyegyeeɛ yi?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29"/>Ne mmaa anyansafoɔ no rema mmuaeɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">ɔtii mu kaa saa nsɛm yi kyerɛɛ ne ho sɛ:<verse eid="JDG 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30"/>‘Wɔrekyɛ asadeɛ a wɔnyaeɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">ɔbarima biara nya ɔbaa baako anaa mmienu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Sisera bɛnya ntadeɛ a ɛyɛ fɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">na me nso menya ntadeɛ a ɛkura ahosuo ahodoɔ na wɔanwono mu fɛɛfɛ.’<verse eid="JDG 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ma wʼatamfoɔ nyinaa nwu sɛ Sisera!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">Nanso, ma wɔn a wɔdɔ wo no nkɔso sɛ owigyinaeɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Afei, asomdwoeɛ baa asase no so mfirinhyia aduanan.<verse eid="JDG 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Gideon Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1"/>Israelfoɔ no yɛɛ deɛ ɛyɛ Awurade ani so bɔne bio. Ɛno enti, Awurade de wɔn hyɛɛ Midianfoɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Midianfoɔ yɛ Abraham ne Ketura asefoɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:2">1 Mose 25.2</ref></char>).</char></note> nsa mfeɛ nson. <verse eid="JDG 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2"/>Esiane sɛ na Midianfoɔ no yɛ atirimuɔdenfoɔ enti, Israelfoɔ no dwane kɔɔ mmepɔ so kɔpɛɛ ahintaeɛ wɔ abodan ne atu mu. <verse eid="JDG 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3"/>Ɛberɛ biara a Israelfoɔ duaa wɔn nnɔbaeɛ no, Midianfoɔ, Amalekfoɔ ne nnipa a wɔte apueeɛ fam no kɔto hyɛ wɔn so. <verse eid="JDG 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4"/>Wɔbɛyɛ atenaeɛ wɔ wɔn asase no so sɛe mfudeɛ no firi Gasa a wɔnnya Israelfoɔ aduane biribiara. Wɔfa nnwan, anantwie ne mfunumu. <verse eid="JDG 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5"/>Saa atamfoɔ dɔm yi de wɔn nyɛmmoa ne wɔn ntomadan foro ba te sɛ ntutummɛ. Wɔtete nyoma a wɔntumi nkane wɔn dodoɔ so na wɔba. Na wɔtena asase no so kɔsi ɛso nneɛma nyinaa bɛsa. <verse eid="JDG 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6"/>Enti Midianfoɔ no maa ɛkɔm baa Israel. Afei Israelfoɔ no su frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pɛɛ mmoa.<verse eid="JDG 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7"/>Ɛberɛ a Midianfoɔ enti, Israelfoɔ su frɛɛ Awurade no, <verse eid="JDG 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa odiyifoɔ kɔɔ wɔn nkyɛn. Ɔkaa sɛ, “Asɛm a Awurade, Israel Onyankopɔn, ka nie: Meyii mo firii Misraim nkoasom mu <verse eid="JDG 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9"/>Meyii mo firii Misraim tumi ne wɔn a wɔhyɛ mo so nyinaa ase. Mepamoo mo atamfoɔ de wɔn asase maa mo. <verse eid="JDG 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10"/>Meka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, ‘Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Monnsom Amorifoɔ a mote wɔn asase so no anyame.’ Nanso moantie me.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11"/>Na Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ bɛtenaa odupɔn a ɛsi Ofra a ɛyɛ Yoas a ɔfiri Abieser abusua mu dea no ase. Na Yoas babarima Gideon reporo ayuo wɔ nsakyiamena ase sɛ ɔde resie Midianfoɔ no. <verse eid="JDG 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ Gideon, kaa sɛ, “Dɔmmarima, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka wo ho.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13"/>Gideon buaa sɛ, “Owura, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka yɛn ho a, adɛn enti na saa nsɛm yi nyinaa aba yɛn so? Na anwanwadeɛ a yɛn agyanom kaa ho asɛm kyerɛɛ yɛn no nso wɔ he? Wɔanka sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii yɛn firii Misraim anaa?’ Nanso, seesei deɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> agyaa yɛn de yɛn ahyɛ Midianfoɔ nsam.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> danee ne ho ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Fa ahoɔden a wowɔ no kɔ na kɔgye Israelfoɔ firi Midianfoɔ no nsam. Me na meresoma wo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15"/>Gideon buaa sɛ, “Na Awurade, mɛyɛ dɛn magye Israelfoɔ? Mʼabusua na ɛyɛ mmerɛ koraa wɔ Manase abusuakuo mu na me na mesua koraa wɔ me fiefoɔ nyinaa mu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Mɛka wo ho. Wobɛsɛe Midianfoɔ no sɛdeɛ woresɛe onipa fua.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17"/>Gideon buaa sɛ, “Sɛ wobɛboa me ampa ara deɛ a, yɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi ma menhunu sɛ, nokorɛm, ɛyɛ wo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na worekasa kyerɛ me yi. <verse eid="JDG 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18"/>Nkɔ, kɔsi sɛ mɛsane mʼakyi aba de mʼafɔrebɔdeɛ abrɛ wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa sɛ, “Mɛtena ha atwɛn kɔsi sɛ wobɛba.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19"/>Gideon yɛɛ ntɛm kɔɔ efie. Ɔkɔsiesie abirekyie ba, too burodo asikyiresiam lita aduonu mmienu a mmɔreka nni mu. Afei, ɔsoaa ɛnam no wɔ kɛntɛn mu a nkwan no nso wɔ ɛsɛn bi mu de baeɛ. Ɔde brɛɛ ɔbɔfoɔ no wɔ odupɔn no ase.<verse eid="JDG 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Fa ɛnam no ne burodo a ɛnkaeɛ no gu ɔbotan yi so na hwie nkwan no gu so.” Na Gideon yɛɛ deɛ ɔbɔfoɔ no kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no. <verse eid="JDG 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no de poma a ɛkura no no kaa ɛnam ne burodo no, na ogya pue firii ɔbotan no mu hyee deɛ ɔde baeɛ no nyinaa. Na ɔbɔfoɔ no yeraeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22"/>Ɛberɛ a Gideon hunuu sɛ ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no, ɔteaam sɛ, “Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mahunu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ animu ne animu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa sɛ, “Nsuro na worenwu.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24"/>Na Gideon sii afɔrebukyia wɔ hɔ maa Awurade na ɔtoo no edin “Awurade Yɛ Asomdwoeɛ.” Afɔrebukyia no da so wɔ Ofra a ɛyɛ Abieserfoɔ abusua asase so de bɛsi ɛnnɛ.<verse eid="JDG 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25"/>Anadwo no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Gideon sɛ, “Kyere nantwinini ɔdi mu, ɔtɔ so mmienu na wadi mfeɛ nson firi wʼagya anantwie mu. Dwiri wʼagya afɔrebukyia a ɔsi maa Baal no, na twa Asera dua a ɛsi nkyɛn no. <verse eid="JDG 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26"/>Afei, si afɔrebukyia wɔ bepɔ yi so ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Onyankopɔn. Hyehyɛ afɔrebukyia aboɔ no yie. Fa nantwinini bɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ wɔ afɔrebukyia no so. Fa Asera dua a wotwaeɛ no yensin yɛ egya.”<verse eid="JDG 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27"/>Enti, Gideon faa nʼasomfoɔ edu de wɔn yɛɛ sɛdeɛ Awurade hyɛɛ noɔ no. Nanso, ɔyɛɛ no anadwo, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔsuro nʼagya fiefoɔ ne kuro mma no. Na ɔnim deɛ ɛbɛsie, sɛ wɔhunu onipa a ɔyɛɛ saa adeɛ no a.<verse eid="JDG 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpahema a kuro no mu nnipa hyɛɛ aseɛ nyanenyaneeɛ no, obi hunuu sɛ wɔadwiri Baal afɔrebukyia no agu, na Asera dua a ɛsi ho no nso, wɔatwa atwene na wɔasi afɔrebukyia foforɔ asi ananmu. Na wɔhunuu afɔrebɔdeɛ bi nkaeɛ wɔ so.<verse eid="JDG 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29"/>Ɔmanfoɔ no bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Hwan na ɔyɛɛ yei?” Wɔbisabisa, too wɔn bo ase feefee mu no, wɔhunuu sɛ Yoas babarima Gideon na ɔyɛɛ saa.<verse eid="JDG 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30"/>Ɔmanfoɔ no teaam guu Yoas so sɛ, “Fa wo babarima no bra. Sɛe a ɔsɛee Baal afɔrebukyia ne twa a ɔtwaa Asera dua no enti, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔwuo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31"/>Nanso, Yoas teaam guu nnipakuo no so sɛ, “Adɛn enti na mogye Baal ti? Mobɛtumi aka nʼasɛm ama no anaa? Obiara a ɔbɛgye ne ti no, wɔbɛkum no ansa na adeɛ akye. Sɛ Baal yɛ onyame bi ampa ara a ɔno ara nni mma ne ho na ɔnkum deɛ ɔdwirii nʼafɔrebukyia no!” <verse eid="JDG 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32"/>Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no rekɔ no, wɔfrɛɛ Gideon Yerubaal a asekyerɛ ne “Baal nni mma ne ne ho,” ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno ara na ɔdwirii Baal afɔrebukyia no guiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33"/>Afei, Midianfoɔ nyinaa, Amalekfoɔ nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔfifiri apueeɛ fam no kaa wɔn ho bɔɔ mu tia Israel. Wɔtwaa Yordan, kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Yesreel bɔnhwa mu. <verse eid="JDG 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34"/>Awurade honhom baa Gideon so na ɔbɔɔ totorobɛnto de frɛɛ dɔm. Mmarima a wɔfiri Abieser abusua mu no baa ne nkyɛn. <verse eid="JDG 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35"/>Ɔsomaa abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Manase, Aser, Sebulon ne Naftali nyinaa mu kɔfrɛɛ wɔn akodɔm, na wɔn nyinaa penee so.<verse eid="JDG 6:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36"/>Gideon ka kyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ, “Sɛ wonam me nsa so bɛgye Israel sɛdeɛ woahyɛ bɔ no a, <verse eid="JDG 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37"/>fa saa ɛkwan yi so kyerɛ me, mede odwannwi bɛkata ayuporobea hɔ anadwo yi. Sɛ obosuo fɔ odwannwi no, na sɛ ɛhɔ amfɔ a, na mahunu sɛ ampa ara, wonam me nsa so bɛgye Israel sɛdeɛ woahyɛ ho bɔ no.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38"/>Na saa na ɛbaeɛ. Gideon sɔree adekyeeɛ kyii odwannwi no mu nyaa nsuo adeɛ ma.<verse eid="JDG 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39"/>Afei, Gideon ka kyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ, “Mma wo bo mfu me. Ma memmisa adeɛ baako. Ma memfa odwannwi no nsɔ biribi nhwɛ. Saa ɛberɛ yi deɛ, ma odwannwi no nyɛ wesee na baabi a ɛda hɔ no nyinaa mfɔ.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40"/>Anadwo no, Onyankopɔn yɛɛ sɛdeɛ Gideon bisaeɛ no. Anɔpa no odwannwi yɛɛ wesee a na obosuo afɔ fam hɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="JDG 6:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Gideon Di Midianfoɔ So Nkonim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1"/>Anɔpahema, Yerubaal (a ɔne Gideon) ne nʼakodɔm kɔɔ ara kɔsii Harod nsuo ho. Midian akodɔm nso bɔɔ dɔmpem wɔ atifi fam wɔ bɔnhwa bi a ɛbɛn More bepɔ no. <verse eid="JDG 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Gideon sɛ, “Akofoɔ a wɔka wo ho no dɔɔso dodo. Sɛ mema mo nyinaa ko tia Midianfoɔ a, Israelfoɔ no bɛhoahoa wɔn ho akyerɛ me sɛ wɔn ara nam wɔn ahoɔden so na wɔgyee wɔn ho sii hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3"/>Ɛno enti, ka kyerɛ nnipa no sɛ, ‘Obiara a ɔyɛ tebɔɔ anaa ɔsuro no, ɔnyi ne ho mfiri mu na ɔnkɔ efie.’ ” Wɔn mu ɔpeduonu mmienu na wɔkɔɔ fie, ɛnna ɛkaa wɔn mu ɔpedu a wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔbɛko.<verse eid="JDG 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Gideon sɛ, “Wɔdɔɔso ara. Fa wɔn bra asuo no ho na mɛsa wɔn mu ayi wɔn a wo ne wɔn bɛkɔ ne wɔn a wɔne wo renkɔ.”<verse eid="JDG 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5"/>Ɛberɛ a Gideon de nʼakofoɔ no kɔɔ nsuo no ho no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Kyɛ nnipa no mu akuo mmienu. Fa nnipa a wɔbɔ nsuo gu wɔn nsam na wɔde wɔn tɛkrɛma tafere no sɛ nkraman no kɔ ekuo baako mu. Ekuo a ɛtɔ so mmienu no nso, fa wɔn a wɔbu nkotodwe de wɔn ano nom nsuo wɔ asuwa mu no hyɛ mu.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6"/>Mmarima no mu ahasa pɛ na na wɔnom nsuo firi wɔn nsa mu. Wɔn a aka no nyinaa nso, na wɔbu nkotodwe de wɔn ano nom nsuo firi asuwa no mu.<verse eid="JDG 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Gideon sɛ, “Menam saa mmarima ahasa yi so bɛgye mo, na mama moadi Midianfoɔ no so nkonim. Ma wɔn a aka no nyinaa nkɔ fie.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8"/>Enti, Gideon gyegyee wɔn akwansoduane ne ntotorobɛnto firii akofoɔ no nkyɛn ma wɔkɔɔ fie. Ɛnna ɔmaa mmarima ahasa no kaa ne nkyɛn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:8">Na Midianfoɔ no atenaeɛ wɔ bɔnhwa a ɛwɔ Gideon ase pɛɛ. <verse eid="JDG 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9"/>Anadwo no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa sɛ, “Sɔre! Kɔ Midianfoɔ no atenaeɛ no mu wɔ aseɛ hɔ, na mɛma mo adi wɔn so nkonim! <verse eid="JDG 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10"/>Na sɛ wosuro sɛ wobɛkoto ahyɛ wɔn so a, wo ne wo ɔsomfoɔ Pura nkɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11"/>Tie deɛ Midianfoɔ no reka na ɛbɛhyɛ wo nkuran. Na wo ho bɛpere wo ama woato ahyɛ wɔn so.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:11">Enti, Gideon faa Pura kaa ne ho ne no kɔɔ atamfoɔ no atenaeɛ no mfikyire. <verse eid="JDG 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Midianfoɔ, Amalekfoɔ ne nnipa no nkaeɛ a wɔfifiri apueeɛ fam no abɛyɛ bitibiti te sɛ ntutummɛ wɔ bɔnhwa no mu. Na wɔn nyoma nso dodoɔ te sɛ mpoano anwea. Wɔdɔɔso dodo!<verse eid="JDG 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13"/>Gideon weaweaa kɔduruu hɔ no, na ɔbarima bi reka ne daeɛ a ɔsoeɛ akyerɛ nʼadamfo bi sɛ, “Mesoo daeɛ na burodo kurukuruwa bi ate abɛhwe Midianfoɔ atenaeɛ. Ɛkɔpem ntomadan no bi na ɛbu faa so ma ɛkɔhwee ase!”<verse eid="JDG 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14"/>Nʼadamfo no kaa sɛ, “Wo daeɛ no kyerɛ adeɛ baako pɛ. Onyankopɔn de Midian ne ne mpamfoɔ nyinaa so nkonimdie ahyɛ Yoas babarima Gideon, Israelni no nsa.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15"/>Ɛberɛ a Gideon tee daeɛ no ne nʼasekyerɛ no, ɔkoto sɔree Onyankopɔn. Ɔsane baa Israel atenaeɛ mu teaam sɛ, “Monsɔre! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de Midianfoɔ ahyɛ mo nsa.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16"/>Ɔkyɛɛ mmarima ahasa no mu akuakuo mmiɛnsa. Ɔde ntotorobɛnto ne dɔteɛ kuruwa a ogyatɛn hyehyɛ mu maa wɔn.<verse eid="JDG 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monhwɛ me. Monni mʼakyi. Sɛ meduru atenaeɛ no mfikyire a, deɛ mɛyɛ biara no, monyɛ bi. <verse eid="JDG 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18"/>Sɛ me ne wɔn a wɔka me ho nyinaa hyɛn ntotorobɛnto no a, mo a moatwa atenaeɛ no ho ahyia no nyinaa, mo nso monhyɛn mo deɛ na monteam sɛ, ‘Yɛko ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne Gideon.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19"/>Anadwo dasuo mu a wɔasesa awɛmfoɔ no awie pɛ, na Gideon ne mmarima ɔha a wɔka ne ho no kɔduruu Midianfoɔ atenaeɛ mfikyire. Mpofirim wɔhyɛnee wɔn ntotorobɛnto no, bobɔɔ dɔteɛ nkuruwa a na ɛhyehyɛ wɔn nsam no. <verse eid="JDG 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20"/>Afei akuo mmiɛnsa no nyinaa hyɛnee wɔn ntotorobɛnto bobɔɔ wɔn nkuruwa. Na wɔkurakura ogyatɛn a ɛrederɛ no wɔ wɔn nsa benkum mu na wɔkurakura ntotorobɛnto wɔ wɔn nsa nifa mu, wɔteaam sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> akofena yɛ Gideon akofena!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21"/>Ɔbarima biara gyinaa nʼafa wɔ atenaeɛ no ho, hwɛɛ Midianfoɔ no sɛ wɔabɔ huboa reteateam na wɔredwane.<verse eid="JDG 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22"/>Ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ ahasa no hyɛnee wɔn ntotorobɛnto no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa wɔn atamfoɔ akofoɔ a wɔwɔ atenaeɛ hɔ no twaa wɔn ho de akofena ne wɔn ho koeɛ. Wɔn a wɔanwu no dwane kɔduruu Bet-Sita a ɛbɛn Serera ne Abel-Mehola hyeɛ a ɛbɛn Tabat so.<verse eid="JDG 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23"/>Afei, Gideon soma kɔfaa Naftali, Aser ne Manase akofoɔ a wɔbɛboa ma wɔtaa Midian akodɔm a wɔredwane no. <verse eid="JDG 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24"/>Gideon tuu abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Efraim mmepɔ aman no so kɔkaa sɛ “Mommra mmɛto nhyɛ Midianfoɔ so. Montware wɔn wɔ Yordan aworɔso a ɛwɔ Bet-Bera hɔ no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:24">Na Efraim mmarima no yɛɛ sɛdeɛ wɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn no. <verse eid="JDG 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25"/>Wɔkyeree Oreb ne Seeb a na wɔyɛ Midian asahene. Wɔkumm Oreb wɔ Oreb botan so ɛnna wɔkumm Seeb nso wɔ Seeb nsakyiamena ho. Na wɔkɔɔ so taa Midianfoɔ no. Akyire no, Israelfoɔ no de Oreb ne Seeb tiri no brɛɛ Gideon a na saa ɛberɛ no ɔwɔ Yordan ho no.<verse eid="JDG 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Gideon Kum Seba Ne Salmunna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1"/>Afei, Efraimfoɔ no bisaa Gideon sɛ, “Adɛn enti na woyɛ yɛn saa? Adɛn enti na worekɔko atia Midian kane no, woamfrɛ yɛn?” Na wɔne Gideon kasaa anibereɛ so.<verse eid="JDG 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2"/>Na Gideon buaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na mayɛ a mede bɛtoto mo ho? Na Efraim bobe aba a ɛka wɔ twaberɛ akyi no nyɛ nsene Abieser bobe a wɔnteeɛ nyinaa? <verse eid="JDG 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3"/>Onyankopɔn ma modii Oreb ne Seeb a na wɔyɛ Midian asahene no so. Ɛdeɛn na matumi ayɛ a ɛsɛ yei?” Efraim mmarima no tee Gideon mmuaeɛ no, wɔn bo tɔɔ wɔn yam.<verse eid="JDG 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4"/>Gideon ne ne mmarima ahasa no twaa Asubɔnten Yordan, ɛwom sɛ na wɔabrɛ deɛ, nanso wɔtoaa so taa atamfoɔ no. <verse eid="JDG 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5"/>Wɔduruu Sukot no, Gideon ka kyerɛɛ ntuanofoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no sɛ, “Momma mʼakofoɔ no aduane nni na wɔabrɛ. Meretaa Midian ahemfo Seba ne Salmuna.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6"/>Na Sukot ntuanofoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Kyere Seba ne Salmuna ansa na yɛama wʼakofoɔ no aduane adi.”<verse eid="JDG 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7"/>Gideon buaa sɛ, “Sɛ Awurade ma medi Seba ne Salmuna so nkonim a, mɛsane aba de ɛserɛ so nkasɛɛ ne akraateɛ abɛsunsuane mo honam ani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8"/>Na Gideon firii hɔ kɔɔ Penuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Penuel yɛ baabi a Yakob ne Onyankopɔn peree so no.</char></note> kɔsrɛɛ aduane bio, na ɔnyaa mmuaeɛ korɔ no ara. <verse eid="JDG 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ Penuelfoɔ no sɛ, “Sɛ mefiri nkonimdie mu ba a, mɛbubu saa abantenten yi.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi na Seba ne Salmuna ne akofoɔ mpem dunum wɔ Karkor, aboafoɔ a wɔfiri apueeɛ fam a na emu ɔpeha aduonu atotɔ dada no nkaeɛfoɔ. <verse eid="JDG 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11"/>Gideon faa atutenafoɔ ɛkwan a ɛda Noba ne Yogbeha apueeɛ fam no ho hyiaeɛ, na wɔto hyɛɛ Midian akodɔm a na wɔn ani nna wɔn ho soɔ no so. <verse eid="JDG 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12"/>Midian ahemfo baanu a wɔn din de Seba ne Salmuna no dwaneeɛ, nanso Gideon taa wɔn faa wɔn akofoɔ nyinaa nnommum.<verse eid="JDG 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13"/>Yei akyi no, Yoas ba Gideon faa Heres kwantempɔn so saneeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14"/>Ɛhɔ na ɔkyeree aberanteɛ bi a ɔfiri Sukot. Ɔhyɛɛ no sɛ ɔntwerɛ nnipa aduɔson nson a wɔyɛ sodifoɔ ne ntuanofoɔ a wɔwɔ kuro no mu no din mma no. <verse eid="JDG 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15"/>Afei, Gideon sane kɔɔ Sukot kɔka kyerɛɛ ɛhɔ ntuanofoɔ no sɛ, “Seba ne Salmuna nie. Yɛbaa ha no modii me ho fɛ, kaa sɛ, ‘Kyere Seba ne Salmuna ansa na yɛama wʼakofoɔ a wɔabrɛ no aduane adi.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16"/>Afei Gideon faa kuro no mu ntuanofoɔ kyerɛɛ wɔn nyansa. Ɔde ɛserɛ so nkasɛɛ ne akraateɛ twee wɔn aso. <verse eid="JDG 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17"/>Ɔsane dwirii Penuel abantenten no guu fam, kunkumm kuro no mu mmarima nyinaa.<verse eid="JDG 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18"/>Afei, ɔbisaa Seba ne Salmuna sɛ, “Mmarima a mokumm wɔn wɔ Tabor no, na wɔte sɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Mmarima no te sɛ wo. Na wɔn mu biara te sɛ ɔheneba.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19"/>Gideon ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Na wɔyɛ me nuanom. Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, sɛ moankum wɔn a, anka me nso merenkum mo.”<verse eid="JDG 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20"/>Ɔdanee nʼani kyerɛɛ ne babarima panin Yeter sɛ, “Ku wɔn.” Nanso Yeter antwe nʼakofena, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔyɛ abarimaa enti na ɔsuro.<verse eid="JDG 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21"/>Seba ne Salmuna ka kyerɛɛ Gideon sɛ, “Mma abarimaa nyɛ ɔpanin adwuma! Wo ankasa yɛ!” Enti, Gideon kumm wɔn baanu, faa adehyeɛ agudeɛ a ɛsensɛn wɔn yoma kɔn mu no.<verse eid="JDG 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gideon Asɔfotadeɛ Kronkron No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22"/>Na Israelfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Gideon sɛ, “Di yɛn so ɔhene. Wo ne wo babarima ne wo nana bɛyɛ yɛn ahemfo, ɛfiri sɛ, woagye yɛn afiri Midianfoɔ nsam.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23"/>Nanso, Gideon buaa sɛ, “Merenni mo so ɔhene na me babarima nso renni mo so ɔhene. Awurade na ɔbɛdi mo so.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24"/>Mmom Gideon ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, mewɔ adebisa baako. “Mo mu biara mma me asomuadeɛ baako a mofa firii asadeɛ a monya firii mo atamfoɔ a modii wɔn so no nkyɛn.” (Atamfoɔ a na wɔyɛ Ismaelfoɔ no na obiara hyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ asomuadeɛ).<verse eid="JDG 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25"/>Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Yɛpene so dodo.” Wɔde akatasoɔ sɛɛ fam. Na obiara de ne sikakɔkɔɔ asomuadeɛ a ɔnyaeɛ bɛguu so. <verse eid="JDG 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26"/>Na sikakɔkɔɔ asomuadeɛ dodoɔ a wɔnyaeɛ no karii kilogram aduonu a asrane nketewa ne kɔnmuadeɛ, Midian ahemfo adehyeɛ ahyehyɛdeɛ ne nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn a ɛgu wɔn yoma kɔn mu nka ho. <verse eid="JDG 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27"/>Gideon de yɛɛ asɔfotadeɛ kronkron na ɔde sii kuro Ofra, ne kurom, mu. Nanso, ankyɛre na Israelfoɔ no kɔsom no de guu wɔn ho fi na ɛdanee afidie maa Gideon ne ne fiefoɔ.<verse eid="JDG 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28"/>Yei ne abasɛm a ɛkyerɛ sɛdeɛ Israelfoɔ dii Midianfoɔ so nkonim a wantumi ansɔre bio. Gideon nna a ɛtwa toɔ bɛyɛ mfeɛ aduanan mu no, na asomdwoeɛ wɔ asase no so.<verse eid="JDG 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29"/>Afei, Yoas babarima Yerub-Baal sane kɔɔ ne kurom. <verse eid="JDG 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30"/>Na ɔwɔ yerenom bebree enti ɔwoo mmammarima aduɔson. <verse eid="JDG 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31"/>Na ɔwɔ mpena nso wɔ Sekem a ɔne no woo ɔbabarima, too ne din Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32"/>Gideon wuiɛ no na wanyini yie. Na wɔsiee no wɔ nʼagya Yoas damena mu wɔ Ofra wɔ Abieserfoɔ abusuasase so.<verse eid="JDG 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33"/>Gideon wuiɛ ara pɛ, Israelfoɔ no kɔsom Baal ahoni, de bɔɔ wɔn ho ahohwi. Wɔnam so yɛɛ Baal-Berit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baal-Berit yɛ onyame bi a na nʼasɔredan si Sekem.</char></note> wɔn nyame. <verse eid="JDG 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34"/>Wɔn werɛ firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn a ɔgyee wɔn firii wɔn atamfoɔ a wɔatwa wɔn ho ahyia no nsam no. <verse eid="JDG 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35"/>Na mpo, wɔanni nokorɛ ankyerɛ Yerub-Baal (a ɔne Gideon) fiefoɔ wɔ nneɛma pa a ɔyɛ maa Israelfoɔ no ho.<verse eid="JDG 8:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Abimelek Di Ɔhene Wɔ Sekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1"/>Ɛda koro bi, Yerub-Baal babarima Abimelek kɔɔ Sekem kɔsraa ne wɔfanom a wɔyɛ ne maame nuanom mmarima. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn ne ne ne maame fiefoɔ nkaeɛfoɔ sɛ, <verse eid="JDG 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2"/>“Mommisa ɔmanfoɔ a wɔwɔ Sekem no sɛ, wɔpɛ sɛ Yerub-Baal mmammarima aduɔson no nyinaa di wɔn so anaasɛ wɔpɛ sɛ ɔbarima baako di wɔn so? Na monkae sɛ meyɛ mo bogyani!”<verse eid="JDG 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3"/>Enti, Abimelek wɔfanom gyinaa nʼanan mu kasa kyerɛɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ Sekem nyinaa. Na wɔtiee wɔn adwenkyerɛ no, wɔpenee so faa Abimelek, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ wɔn busuani. <verse eid="JDG 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4"/>Wɔfaa dwetɛ sika pranpran aduɔson firi Baal-Berit asɔreeɛ so de maa Abimelek, na ɔde faa asraafoɔ a wɔpenee so sɛ wobɛdi nʼakyi. <verse eid="JDG 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5"/>Ɔde asraafoɔ no kɔɔ nʼagya kurom wɔ Ofra. Na ɛhɔ, ɛboɔ bi so, na ɔkunkumm nʼagya mmammarima aduɔson no nyinaa. Nanso ne nuanom mu akumaa koraa a wɔfrɛ no Yotam no dwane kɔtɛɛ baabi. <verse eid="JDG 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6"/>Enti, Sekemfoɔ ne Bet-Milofoɔ yɛɛ nhyiamu wɔ odupɔn a ɛbɛn nkaeɛdum a ɛwɔ Sekem no ase. Wɔsii Abimelek wɔn so ɔhene.<verse eid="JDG 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7"/>Yotam tee asɛm yi no, ɔforo kɔɔ Gerisim bepɔ no atifi na ɔteaam ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Sekemfoɔ montie me! Sɛ mopɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn tie mo deɛ a, montie me! <verse eid="JDG 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8"/>Ɛberɛ bi, nnua nyinaa pɛɛ sɛ wɔsi wɔn so ɔhene. Deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, wɔka kyerɛɛ ngo dua sɛ, ‘Bɛdi yɛn so ɔhene!’<verse eid="JDG 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9"/>“Nanso, wampene so kaa sɛ, ‘Adɛn? Mennyae me ngo a wɔde hyɛ Onyankopɔn ne nnipa animuonyam no, na menkɔkyinkyin nnua a aka so anaa?’<verse eid="JDG 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10"/>“Afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ borɔdɔma sɛ, ‘Bɛdi yɛn so ɔhene!’<verse eid="JDG 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11"/>“Borɔdɔma nso buaa sɛ, ‘Na mennyae aba so na menkyini nnua foforɔ so?’<verse eid="JDG 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12"/>“Afei wɔka kyerɛɛ bobe sɛ, ‘Bɛdi yɛn so ɔhene.’<verse eid="JDG 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13"/>“Na bobe no buaa sɛ, ‘Sɛ megyae me nsa pa a ɛma anyame ne nnipa anigyeɛ no ma a, na afei na merebɛkyini nnua bi so?’<verse eid="JDG 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14"/>“Ne korakora ne sɛ, nnua no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ nkasɛɛ sɛ, ‘Bɛdi yɛn so ɔhene.’<verse eid="JDG 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15"/>“Na nkasɛɛ buaa sɛ, ‘Sɛ ɛyɛ mo adwene kann sɛ mode me bɛsi mo so ɔhene a, mommra mmɛhyɛ me nwunu yi ase. Sɛ ɛnte saa a, momma ogya mfiri nkasɛɛ mu mmɛhye Lebanon ntweneduro nyinaa.’<verse eid="JDG 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16"/>“Afei mogye di sɛ moayɛ deɛ ɛho wɔ nyam, na ɛnam ne kwan mu sɛ mode Abimelek asi mo so ɔhene, na moayɛ Yerub-Baal ne nʼasefoɔ nyinaa apɛdeɛ. Moayɛ deɛ ɛfata ama mʼagya anaa? <verse eid="JDG 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17"/>Na ɔko maa mo de ne ho bɔɔ afɔdeɛ ɛberɛ a ɔgyee mo firii Midianfoɔ nsam no. <verse eid="JDG 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18"/>Na ɛnnɛ moasɔre atia mʼagya ne nʼasefoɔ, akunkum ne mmammarima aduɔson wɔ ɛboɔ baako so. Mode Abimelek a ɔyɛ ne ɔsomfoɔ baa babarima asi Sekem manfoɔ so ɔhene, sɛ ɔyɛ mo busuani enti. <verse eid="JDG 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19"/>Sɛ moayɛ deɛ ɛho wɔ nyam na ɛnam ne kwan mu ama Yerub-Baal ne nʼasefoɔ a, ɛnneɛ mobɛnya ahosɛpɛ wɔ Abimelek mu na ɔno nso anya ahosɛpɛ wɔ mo mu. <verse eid="JDG 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20"/>Sɛ deɛ moayɛ no mfa ne kwan mu deɛ a, ɛnneɛ ogya mfiri Abimelek nkyɛn mmɛhye mo, Sekemfoɔ ne Bet-Milofoɔ. Na ogya nso mfiri Sekemfoɔ ne Bet-Milofoɔ nkyɛn mmɛhye Abimelek!”<verse eid="JDG 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21"/>Na ɛsiane Abimelek ho suro enti, ne nuabarima Yotam dwane kɔtenaa Beer.<verse eid="JDG 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sekem Sɔre Tia Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22"/>Abimelek dii Israel so mfeɛ mmiɛnsa akyi no, <verse eid="JDG 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23"/>Onyankopɔn somaa honhom fi bi maa ɔde ɔhaw baa Abimelek ne Sekem mpanimfoɔ ntam na wɔtee atua. <verse eid="JDG 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24"/>Nsɛm a ɛsisii akyire no mu no, Onyankopɔn twee Abimelek ne Sekemfoɔ aso sɛ wɔkunkumm Yerub-Baal mmammarima aduɔson no. <verse eid="JDG 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25"/>Sekem mmarima bi kɔtɛɛ Abimelek wɔ mmepɔ atifi, na wɔbɔɔ obiara a ɔtwaam wɔ hɔ no apoo. Nnipa bi kɔɔ Abimelek nkyɛn kɔtii nʼase.<verse eid="JDG 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, Ebed babarima Gaal ne ne nuammarima kɔɔ Sekem. Na Sekemfoɔ no nyaa wɔn mu awerɛhyɛmu. <verse eid="JDG 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔredi otwa afahyɛ wɔ Sekem wɔ ɛhɔ nyame bi asɔreeɛ so no, bobesa buu so hɔ maa obiara hyɛɛ aseɛ domee Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28"/>Ebed babarima Gaal teaam sɛ, “Hwan ne Abimelek? Ɔnyɛ Sekem aseni kann, na adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ nʼasomfoɔ? Ɔyɛ Yerub-Baal babarima kɛkɛ na Sebul na ɔtoto ne ɔman ho nhyehyɛeɛ ma no. Monsom nnipa a wɔfiri Hamor, wɔn na wɔyɛ Sekem asefoɔ kann. Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛsom Abimelek? <verse eid="JDG 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29"/>Sɛ mewɔ tumi a, anka mɛyi Abimelek afiri hɔ. Anka mɛka akyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Pɛ asraafoɔ bebree bra bɛko!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30"/>Na Sebul a ɔtua kuro no ano tee deɛ Ebed babarima Gaal rekeka no, ne bo fuiɛ. <verse eid="JDG 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31"/>Ɔsomaa abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Abimelek nkyɛn wɔ Aruma, kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ebed babarima Gaal ne ne nuammarima abɛtena Sekem na wɔretu ɔmanfoɔ no aso sɛ wɔnsɔre ntia wo. <verse eid="JDG 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32"/>Fa akodɔm bra anadwo bɛtɛ mfuo yi mu. <verse eid="JDG 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ ara pɛ, to hyɛ kuropɔn yi so. Na sɛ Gaal ne nʼapamfoɔ ba bɛtia wo a, deɛ wopɛ biara wotumi yɛ wɔn.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34"/>Na Abimelek ne ne mmarima kɔɔ anadwo no, na wɔkyɛɛ wɔn mu akuo ɛnan de twaa Sekem ho hyiaeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35"/>Ɛberɛ a Abimelek ne nʼakodɔm pue firii atɛeɛ mu no, na Ebed babarima Gaal gyina kuro no ɛpono ano. <verse eid="JDG 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36"/>Ɛberɛ a Gaal hunuu wɔn no, ɔka kyerɛɛ Sebul sɛ, “Hwɛ, nnipa bi firi bepɔ no so reba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Sebul buaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ mmepɔ no sunsum na ayɛ sɛ nnipa no.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37"/>Nanso Gaal sane kaa sɛ, “Dabi, nnipa bi resiane mmepɔ no. Na ekuo foforɔ nso nam ɛkwan a ɛfa Akɔmfoɔ Dupɔn ho no reba.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38"/>Afei, Sebul dane guu ne so sɛ, “Anosɛm a na woyeyɛ no aseɛ ne sɛn? Ɛnyɛ wo ara na wokaa sɛ ‘Hwan ne Abimelek, na adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ ne nkoa’ no? Nnipa a wodii wɔn ho fɛ no, wɔaduru yɛn mfikyire ha yi ara! Kɔ na wo ne wɔn nkɔko!”<verse eid="JDG 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39"/>Enti Gaal dii Sekem mmarima anim sɛ wɔrekɔko atia Abimelek, <verse eid="JDG 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40"/>nanso, ɔdii nkoguo na ɔdwaneeɛ. Wɔkunkumm Sekem akofoɔ bebree sɛɛ wɔn afunu kɛtɛ wɔ ɛkwan a ɛkɔ kuropɔn no ɛpono ano no so. <verse eid="JDG 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41"/>Abimelek tenaa Aruma ɛnna Sebul pamoo Gaal ne ne nuanom mmarima firii Sekem.<verse eid="JDG 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Sekemfoɔ no kɔɔ wira mu sɛ wɔrekɔko. Abimelek teeɛ no, <verse eid="JDG 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43"/>ɔkyɛɛ ne mmarima mu akuakuo mmiɛnsa ma wɔkɔtetɛɛ wira mu. Ɛberɛ a Abimelek hunuu sɛ nnipa no firi kuropɔn no mu reba no, ɔne ne mmarima no firii wɔn atɛeɛ mu to hyɛɛ wɔn so. <verse eid="JDG 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44"/>Abimelek ne ne kuo no kɔgyee kuropɔn no ɛpono ano hɔ faeɛ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Sekemfoɔ rentumi nsane wɔn akyi. Afei, akuo mmienu to hyɛɛ Sekemfoɔ a wɔwɔ wiram hɔ no so kunkumm wɔn. <verse eid="JDG 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45"/>Ɔko no kɔɔ so ɛda mu no nyinaa ansa na Abimelek redi kuropɔn no so koraa. Ɔkunkumm nnipa no, sɛee kuropɔn no, na ɔpetee nkyene wɔ hɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="JDG 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46"/>Nnipa a wɔte Sekem abantenten mu tee asɛm a asi no, wɔkɔhintaa Baal-Berit asɔreeɛ so. <verse eid="JDG 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47"/>Obi kɔbɔɔ Abimelek amaneɛ sɛ nnipa no bi aboa wɔn ho ano wɔ asɔreeɛ so hɔ, <verse eid="JDG 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48"/>enti ɔdii nʼakodɔm anim kɔɔ Salmon Bepɔ so. Ɔfaa akuma twaa mman bi firii dua bi so na ɔde guu ne mmati so. Ɔka kyerɛɛ ne dɔm no sɛ, “Ntɛm, deɛ mayɛ yi, monyɛ bi!” <verse eid="JDG 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49"/>Enti, wɔn mu biara twitwaa dua mman no bi, sɛdeɛ Abimelek yɛeɛ no. Wɔboaa mman no ano wɔ asɔreeɛ no afasuo ho de ogya too mu. Enti, nnipa a na wɔte Sekem abantenten mu a wɔn dodoɔ bɛyɛ mmarima ne mmaa apem no nyinaa wuwuiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50"/>Afei Abimelek to hyɛɛ kuropɔn Tebes so dii so. <verse eid="JDG 9:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51"/>Nanso, na abandenden bi wɔ kuropɔn no mu. Ɛno enti, kuropɔn no mu nnipa nyinaa dwane kɔhyɛɛ mu. Wɔtoo wɔn ho ɛpono mu, foforo kɔɔ abandenden no atifi pɛɛ. <verse eid="JDG 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52"/>Abimelek toaa wɔn sɛ ɔrekɔto ahyɛ abandenden no so. Ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔreto mu ogya pɛ, <verse eid="JDG 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53"/>ɔbaa bi a ɔwɔ abandenden no atifi gyaa ayuyammoɔ mu ma ɛbɛbɔɔ Abimelek moma so na ɛpɛkyɛɛ ne ti kwankoraa.<verse eid="JDG 9:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54"/>Abimelek ka kyerɛɛ aberanteɛ a ɔkura nʼakodeɛ sɛ, “Twe wʼakofena na kum me! Na nnipa anka sɛ ɔbaabasia na ɔkumm Abimelek!” Enti, aberanteɛ no de nʼakofena wɔɔ no ma ɔwuiɛ. <verse eid="JDG 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55"/>Ɛberɛ a Abimelek nkurɔfoɔ hunuu sɛ wawuo no, wɔde wɔn akodeɛ guu hɔ sane kɔɔ wɔn afie mu.<verse eid="JDG 9:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56"/>Saa na Onyankopɔn twee Abimelek aso wɔ bɔne a ɔyɛ de tiaa nʼagya sɛ ɔkumm ne nuammarima aduɔson no. <verse eid="JDG 9:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57"/>Saa ara na Onyankopɔn twee mmarima a wɔwɔ Sekem aso wɔ wɔn bɔne ahodoɔ a wɔyɛeɛ no ho. Ɛno enti, Yerub-Baal babarima Yotam nnome no baa mu.<verse eid="JDG 9:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Tola Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1"/>Abimelek wuo akyi no, Pua a ɔyɛ Dodo aseni no babarima Tola ba bɛgyee Israel. Na ɔfiri Isakar abusuakuo mu, nanso ɔtenaa Samir a ɛwɔ Efraim bepɔ asase so. <verse eid="JDG 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2"/>Ɔyɛɛ Israel so ɔtemmufoɔ mfeɛ aduonu mmiɛnsa. Ɔwuiɛ no wɔsiee no wɔ Samir.<verse eid="JDG 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yair Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3"/>Tola wuo akyi no, Yair a ɔfiri Gilead bɛyɛɛ Israel so ɔtemmufoɔ mfeɛ aduonu mmienu. <verse eid="JDG 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4"/>Ne mmammarima aduasa tena wɔn mfunumu so kyinkyini, na wɔdi nkuro aduasa so wɔ Gilead asase so, a ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ wɔfrɛ hɔ Yair Nkuro. <verse eid="JDG 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5"/>Yair wuiɛ na wɔsiee no Kamon.<verse eid="JDG 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amonfoɔ Hyɛ Israelfoɔ So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6"/>Bio, Israelfoɔ yɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so bɔne. Wɔsomm Baal ne Astoret ahoni ne Aram, Sidon, Moab, Amon ne Filistia anyame. Wɔtwee wɔn ho firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho a wɔansom no koraa. <verse eid="JDG 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7"/>Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu Israelfoɔ, na ɔde wɔn hyɛɛ Filistifoɔ ne Amorifoɔ nsa, <verse eid="JDG 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8"/>na wɔfirii aseɛ hyɛɛ wɔn so saa afe no. Wɔhyɛɛ Israelfoɔ a wɔwɔ Asubɔnten Yordan apueeɛ fam wɔ Amorifoɔ (wɔ Gilead) asase no so mfeɛ dunwɔtwe. <verse eid="JDG 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9"/>Amorifoɔ no nso twaa Yordan kɔɔ atɔeɛ fam kɔto hyɛɛ Yuda, Benyamin ne Efraim so, Israelfoɔ kɔɔ ahokyere kɛseɛ mu. <verse eid="JDG 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10"/>Afei Israelfoɔ su frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Yɛayɛ bɔne atia wo, ɛfiri sɛ yɛatwe yɛn ho afiri yɛn Onyankopɔn ho na yɛasom Baal ahoni.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa sɛ, “Mannye mo amfiri Misraimfoɔ, Amorifoɔ, Amonfoɔ, Filistifoɔ <verse eid="JDG 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12"/>Sidonfoɔ, Amalekfoɔ ne Maonfoɔ nsam? Ɛberɛ a wɔhyɛɛ mo so no, mosu frɛɛ me na megyee mo. <verse eid="JDG 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13"/>Nanso, moagya me akɔsom anyame foforɔ. Ɛno enti, merennye mo bio. <verse eid="JDG 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14"/>Monkɔsu nkyerɛ anyame a moafa wɔn no. Momma wɔnnye mo ɛberɛ a morehunu amaneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15"/>Nanso, Israelfoɔ no kɔɔ so srɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Yɛayɛ bɔne. Twe yɛn aso sɛdeɛ ɛfata. Nanso, gye yɛn firi yɛn atamfoɔ nsam ɛnnɛ.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16"/>Na Israelfoɔ no too ananafoɔ anyame no guu nkyɛn bɛsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho yeraa no wɔ wɔn ahokyere no ho.<verse eid="JDG 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Amonfoɔ asraadɔm aboa wɔn ho ano wɔ Gilead, sɛ wɔrekɔto ahyɛ Israel akodɔm so wɔ Mispa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18"/>Na Gilead ntuanofoɔ no keka kyerɛɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Obiara a ɔbɛdi ɛkan ato ahyɛ Amonfoɔ so no, bɛyɛ deɛ ɔbɛdi Gileadfoɔ nyinaa so.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yefta Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1"/>Gileadni Yefta yɛ ɔkofoɔ kɛseɛ. Nʼagya din de Gilead. Nanso ne maame yɛ ɔbaa dwamanfoɔ. <verse eid="JDG 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2"/>Gilead yere woo mmammarima bebree, na saa mmammarima no nyinyiniiɛ no, wɔpamoo Yefta firii asase no so. Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Worennya yɛn agya agyapadeɛ biara, ɛfiri sɛ, woyɛ ɔbaa dwamanfoɔ bi ba.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3"/>Enti Yefta dwane firii ne nuanom nkyɛn kɔtenaa Tob asase so. Ankyɛre, ɔnyaa atuatefoɔ bebree bɛdii nʼakyi.<verse eid="JDG 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4"/>Ɛberɛ korɔ yi ara, Amonfoɔ de ɔko bɛkaa Israel. <verse eid="JDG 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5"/>Ɛberɛ a Amonfoɔ to hyɛɛ Israelfoɔ so, Gilead mpanimfoɔ soma kɔfaa Yefta firii Tob asase so baeɛ. Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <verse eid="JDG 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6"/>“Bra na bɛyɛ yɛn so ɔsahene! Boa yɛn ma yɛne Amonfoɔ nko.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7"/>Yefta bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ mo na motane me, pamoo me firii mʼagya fie no? Adɛn enti na afei a mowɔ ɔhaw mu no, morebɛfrɛ me?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8"/>Gilead mpanimfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Yefta sɛ, “Wo ho hia yɛn. Sɛ wodi yɛn anim ma yɛko tia Amonfoɔ a, yɛbɛyɛ wo Gileadfoɔ nyinaa sodifoɔ.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9"/>Yefta buaa sɛ, “Sɛ me ne mo kɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma medi Amonfoɔ so nkonim a, ampa ara sɛ mode me bɛyɛ nnipa no nyinaa sodifoɔ anaa?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10"/>Gilead ntuanofoɔ no buaa no sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne yɛn danseni. Yɛbɛyɛ sɛdeɛ woka biara.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11"/>Enti, Yefta ne ntuanofoɔ no kɔɔ Gilead. Na wɔde no yɛɛ wɔn sodifoɔ ne ɔsahene. Na Yefta tii nsɛm no nyinaa mu wɔ Mispa wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim.<verse eid="JDG 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12"/>Afei, Yefta somaa abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Amonfoɔ ɔhene nkyɛn sɛ wɔnkɔbisa no deɛ enti a ɔrebɛto ahyɛ Israel so. <verse eid="JDG 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13"/>Amonfoɔ ɔhene buaa Yefta abɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Ɛberɛ a Israel firii Misraim baeɛ no, wɔfaa mʼasase a ɛfiri Asubɔnten Arnon de kɔsi Asubɔnten Yabok, toaso kɔsi Yordan. Enti, sane fa mʼadeɛ ma me asomdwoeɛ mu.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14"/>Na Yefta sane somaa abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Amonfoɔ ɔhene hɔ sɛ,<verse eid="JDG 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15"/>“Sɛdeɛ Yefta seɛ nie: Israel amfa Moab asase anaa Amonfoɔ asase biara. <verse eid="JDG 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16"/>Ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ tuu kwan firii Misraim, twaa Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ na wɔduruu Kades no, <verse eid="JDG 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17"/>wɔsomaa abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Edomhene hɔ sɛ ɔmma wɔn ɛkwan na wɔmfa nʼasase no so. Nanso Edomhene ampene. Wɔsoma ma wɔkɔɔ Moabhene hɔ, nanso ɔno nso ampene. Enti, Israelfoɔ tenaa Kades.<verse eid="JDG 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18"/>“Ne korakora ne sɛ, wɔnam ɛserɛ so twa faa Edom ne Moab ho hyiaeɛ. Wɔfaa Edom apueeɛ fam hyeɛ so kyeree sraban wɔ Asubɔnten Arnon fa hɔ. Nanso, wɔantwa Asubɔnten Arnon ankɔ Moab asase so.<verse eid="JDG 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19"/>“Afei, Israelfoɔ somaa abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Amorifoɔhene Sihon a ɔdii adeɛ firi Hesbon na wɔbisaa ɛkwan sɛ wɔpɛ sɛ wɔfa nʼasase so kɔ baabi a wɔrekɔ. <verse eid="JDG 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20"/>Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ na ɔhene Sihon nni Israelfoɔ mu gyidie enti ɔboaboaa ne dɔm ano wɔ Yahas maa wɔto hyɛɛ wɔn so.<verse eid="JDG 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21"/>“Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, maa ne nkurɔfoɔ dii ɔhene Sihon so. Enti, Israelfoɔ faa Amorifoɔ asase a na wɔte so wɔ ɔmantam no mu <verse eid="JDG 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22"/>firi Asubɔnten Arnon de kɔsi Asubɔnten Yabok, firi ɛserɛ no so de kɔsi Yordan nyinaa dii so.<verse eid="JDG 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23"/>“Enti, moahunu, ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn na ɔgyee asase no firii Amorifoɔ nsam na ɔde maa Israel. Enti, adɛn na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛde ma mo? <verse eid="JDG 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24"/>Deɛ mo nyame Kemos de maa mo no momfa, na yɛn nso, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn de maa yɛn biara no yɛafa. <verse eid="JDG 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25"/>Mosene Sipor babarima Balak a na ɔyɛ Moabhene no? Ɔne Israel twee asase bi so manso anaa? Ɔkɔɔ ɔko anaa? Dabi. <verse eid="JDG 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26"/>Na afei, mfeɛ ahasa akyi, na woama saa asɛm yi so? Israel atena ha saa ɛberɛ tenten yi, wɔatrɛ afiri Hesbon asase so, akɔsi Aroer ne nkuro no nyinaa so, akɔfa Asubɔnten Arnon ano. Adɛn enti na dadaada yi moanyɛ mo adwene sɛ mobɛgye asase yi? <verse eid="JDG 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27"/>Menyɛɛ mo bɔne. Mmom, mo na moayɛ me bɔne sɛ moto hyɛɛ me so. Momma Awurade a ɔyɛ ɔtemmufoɔ no mmua ɛnnɛ, sɛ yɛn mu hwan na nʼasɛm yɛ dɛ? Israel anaa Amon.”<verse eid="JDG 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28"/>Nanso, Amonhene amfa Yefta asɛm no asɛmhia.<verse eid="JDG 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yefta Ntam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Honhom baa Yefta so ma ɔkɔɔ Gilead ne Manase nsase nyinaa so a, Mispa a ɛwɔ Gilead ka ho. Na ɔdii akodɔm anim to hyɛɛ Amonfoɔ so. <verse eid="JDG 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30"/>Na Yefta hyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔ. Ɔkaa sɛ, “Sɛ woma medi Amonfoɔ so a, <verse eid="JDG 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31"/>mede adeɛ a ɛbɛdi ɛkan afiri me fie abɛhyia me ɛberɛ a mede nkonimdie reba no, bɛma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Mede bɛma no sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32"/>Ɛnna Yefta dii nʼakodɔm anim tiaa Amonfoɔ, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma ɔdii nkonim. <verse eid="JDG 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33"/>Ɔdii Amonfoɔ so pasaa, sɛee nkuro bɛyɛ aduonu, firii Aroer de kɔsii baabi a ɛbɛn Minit, kɔeɛ ara kɔsii Abel-Keramim. Saa ɛkwan yi na Israelfoɔ faa so kaa Amonfoɔ hyɛeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34"/>Ɛberɛ a Yefta firi akono kɔɔ ne fie wɔ Mispa no, ne babaa, a ɔyɛ ne ba korɔ no, tuu mmirika bɛhyiaa no a ɔrebɔ akasaeɛ, na anigyeɛ enti, ɔresa. <verse eid="JDG 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35"/>Yefta hunuu no no, ɔde awerɛhoɔ sunsuanee ne ntadeɛ mu, teaam sɛ, “Ao, me ba, mʼakoma rete! Ɛdeɛn ahometesɛm sɛ woaba, rebɛhyia me. Na maka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntam na merentumi mmu so.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36"/>Ne babaa no buaa sɛ, “Mʼagya, woahyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔ. Yɛ me sɛdeɛ woahyɛ bɔ no, ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama woadi wʼatamfoɔ a wɔyɛ Amonfoɔ no so nkonim. <verse eid="JDG 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37"/>Nanso, deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, ma memforo mmepɔ nkɔkyinkyini so na me ne me nnamfonom nsu abosome mmienu, ɛfiri sɛ, mɛwu sɛ ababaawa a menhunuu ɔbarima da.”<verse eid="JDG 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38"/>Yefta ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wotumi kɔ.” Enti, ɔmaa no kɔ kɔdii abosome mmienu. Ɔne ne nnamfonom kɔɔ mmepɔ no so kɔsuiɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔrennya mma. <verse eid="JDG 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔsane baa fie no, nʼagya dii ne bɔhyɛ so. Enti ɔwuu sɛ ababaawa a ɔnhunuu ɔbarima da.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Yei abɛyɛ amanneɛ wɔ Israel <verse eid="JDG 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40"/>ama Israel mmaabunu sɛ afe biara wɔbɛkɔ baabi akɔdi nna ɛnan na wɔakɔsu Yefta babaa no nkrabea.<verse eid="JDG 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Efraim Ne Yefta Ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1"/>Efraim abusuakuo no boaboaa akodɔm ano twa kɔɔ Safon. Wɔde nkra yi kɔmaa Yefta: “Adɛn enti na woansoma ammɛka ankyerɛ yɛn sɛ yɛmmɛboa mo nko ntia Amonfoɔ? Yɛrebɛhye wo ne wo fie nyinaa pasaa!”<verse eid="JDG 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2"/>Yefta buaa sɛ, “Mansotwe no ahyɛaseɛ no, mefrɛɛ mo, nanso moamma. Moammɛboa yɛn wɔ yɛne Amonfoɔ apereapereɛ no mu. <verse eid="JDG 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3"/>Mede me nkwa too me nsam kɔkoeɛ a monnka ho, nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma medii Amonfoɔ so nkonim. Na adɛn enti na afei woaba sɛ wo ne me rebɛko?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4"/>Efraimfoɔ ntuanofoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Gileadfoɔ nyɛ nnipa biara sɛ adwanefoɔ a wɔfiri Efraim ne Manase.” Enti Yefta frɛɛ nʼakodɔm, wɔto hyɛɛ Efraimfoɔ so, dii wɔn so nkonim.<verse eid="JDG 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5"/>Yefta ko faa Yordan aworɔso. Ɛberɛ biara a odwanefoɔ bi a ɔfiri Efraim pɛ sɛ ɔfa hɔ dwane kɔ nʼakyi no, Gileadfoɔ no bisa no sɛ, “Wofiri Efraim abusua mu anaa?” Sɛ ɔbarima no bua sɛ, “Dabi” a, <verse eid="JDG 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6"/>wɔka kyerɛ no sɛ, ɔnka “Sibolet.” Sɛ ɔfiri Efraim a, ɔka, “Sibolet,” Ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa a wɔfiri Efraim no ntumi nka saa asɛm no yie. Sɛ ɛba saa a, na wɔakye no akɔkum no wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan aworɔso hɔ. Enti, Efraimfoɔ ɔpeduanan mmienu na wɔkunkumm wɔn saa ɛberɛ no.<verse eid="JDG 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7"/>Yefta yɛɛ Israel so ɔtemmufoɔ mfeɛ nsia. Ɔwuiɛ no, wɔsiee no wɔ Gilead nkuro no baako so.<verse eid="JDG 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibsan Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8"/>Yefta akyi no, Ibsan na ɔbɛyɛɛ ɔtemmufoɔ wɔ Israel. Ɔtenaa Betlehem. <verse eid="JDG 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9"/>Na ɔwɔ mmammarima aduasa ne mmammaa nso aduasa. Ɔmaa ne mmammaa no warewaree firii mmusua foforɔ mu. Ne mmammarima no deɛ, ɔfaa mmaabunu aduasa firii mmusua foforɔ mu ma wɔbɛwarewaree wɔn. Ibsan buu Israel atɛn mfeɛ nson. <verse eid="JDG 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10"/>Ɔwuiɛ no, wɔsiee no wɔ Betlehem.<verse eid="JDG 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elon Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11"/>Ibsan akyi no, Elon a ɔfiri Sebulon na ɔbɛyɛɛ ɔtemmufoɔ wɔ Israel. Ɔbuu Israel atɛn mfeɛ edu. <verse eid="JDG 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔwuiɛ no, wɔsiee no wɔ Ayalon, Sebulon asase so.<verse eid="JDG 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abdon Bɛyɛ Israel So Ɔtemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13"/>Elon wuo akyi no, Hilel babarima Abdon a ɔfiri Piraton na ɔbɛyɛɛ ɔtemmufoɔ wɔ Israel. <verse eid="JDG 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14"/>Ɔnyaa mmammarima aduanan ne mmanananom aduasa a na wɔn mu biara tena mfunumu so. Ɔyɛɛ ɔtemmufoɔ wɔ Israel mfeɛ nwɔtwe. <verse eid="JDG 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15"/>Ɔwuiɛ ma wɔsiee no wɔ Piraton wɔ Efraim asase a ɛwɔ Amalekfoɔ bepɔ asase no so.<verse eid="JDG 12:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Samson Awoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1"/>Bio, Israelfoɔ no yɛɛ deɛ ɛyɛ bɔne wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so, enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de wɔn hyɛɛ Filistifoɔ nsam ma wɔhyɛɛ wɔn so mfeɛ aduanan.<verse eid="JDG 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, ɔbarima bi tenaa Sora a ne din de Manoa a ɔfiri Dan abusuakuo mu. Na ne yere nnya awoɔ, enti na wɔnni mma. <verse eid="JDG 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ yii ne ho kyerɛɛ Manoa yere kaa sɛ, “Ɛwom sɛ wonnyaa awoɔ deɛ, nanso, ɛrenkyɛre worebɛnyinsɛn na woawo ɔbabarima. <verse eid="JDG 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ wonom bobesa anaa nsã a ano yɛ den biara. Na nni biribiara nso a ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5"/>Wobɛnyinsɛn na woawo ɔbabarima, na hwɛ sɛ oyiwan nka ne tire, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ Nasareni a wɔayi no asi hɔ ama Onyankopɔn firi awoɔ mu. Ɔbɛgye Israel afiri Filistifoɔ nsam.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6"/>Ɔbaa no de mmirika kɔɔ ne kunu nkyɛn kɔbɔɔ no amaneɛ sɛ, “Onyankopɔn onipa bi yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ me. Na ɔte sɛ Onyankopɔn abɔfoɔ no mu baako a ne ho yɛ hu yie. Mammisa no baabi a ɔfiri baeɛ, na ɔno nso ammɔ ne din ankyerɛ me. <verse eid="JDG 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7"/>Nanso, ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Wobɛnyinsɛn na woawo ɔbabarima. Enti nnom bobesa anaa nsã a ano yɛ den na nni biribiara a ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ. Na wo babarima no bɛyɛ obi a wɔayi no asi hɔ ama Onyankopɔn sɛ Nasareni firi awoɔ mu kɔsi ɛberɛ a ɔbɛwu.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8"/>Na Manoa bɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mpaeɛ sɛ, “Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mesrɛ wo, ma Onyankopɔn onipa no nsane mmra yɛn nkyɛn na ɔmmɛkyerɛ yɛn nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛfa abarimaa a yɛbɛwo noɔ no ho.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9"/>Onyankopɔn tiee Manoa. Ɔbɔfoɔ no yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ no bio wɔ ɛberɛ a ɔwɔ afuom. Nanso, na ne kunu Manoa nka ne ho wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10"/>Ɔbaa no yɛɛ ntɛm kɔbɔɔ ne kunu amaneɛ sɛ, “Ɔbarima a ɔyii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ me ɛda no no asane aba bio!”<verse eid="JDG 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11"/>Manoa yɛɛ ntɛm dii ne yere akyi. Ɔduruu ɔbarima no ho no, ɔbisaa no sɛ, “Wo na wokaa biribi kyerɛɛ me yere no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Aane, ɛyɛ me.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12"/>Enti, Manoa bisaa no sɛ, “Sɛ nsɛm a woaka no ba mu a, mmara bɛn na ɛwɔ hɔ ma abarimaa no asetena ne nʼadwumayɛ?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Hwɛ sɛ wo yere bɛdi nhyehyɛeɛ a mekyerɛɛ noɔ no so. <verse eid="JDG 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔdi bobe anaa biribiara a ɛfiri bobe mu. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔnom bobesa anaa nsã a ano yɛ den. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔdi aduane biara a ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15"/>Enti, Manoa ka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Mesrɛ wo, tena ha kɔsi sɛ yɛbɛsiesie abirekyie ba bi ama woadi ansa na woakɔ.”<verse eid="JDG 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Mɛtena, nanso, merenni biribiara. Mmom, motumi siesie ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ sɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ de ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.” (Na Manoa anhunu sɛ ɔyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ.)<verse eid="JDG 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17"/>Afei, Manoa bisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Wo din de sɛn? Sɛ nsɛm yi nyinaa ba mu a, yɛpɛ sɛ yɛhyɛ wo animuonyam.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no bisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wobisa me din? Sɛ mebɔ me din kyerɛ wo a, worente aseɛ.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19"/>Afei, Manoa faa abirekyie ba no ne aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ de bɔɔ afɔdeɛ wɔ ɔbotan bi so maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Na Manoa ne ne yere rehwɛ no, Awurade yɛɛ anwanwadeɛ bi. <verse eid="JDG 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20"/>Egyadɛreɛ a ɛwɔ afɔrebukyia no mu no tene kɔɔ ewiem no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no faa mu foro kɔeɛ. Na Manoa ne ne yere hunuu saa no, wɔde wɔn anim butubutuu fam.<verse eid="JDG 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no anyi ne ho adi bio ankyerɛ Manoa ne ne yere. Afei, Manoa hunuu sɛ ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ, <verse eid="JDG 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22"/>na ɔka kyerɛɛ ne yere sɛ, “Yɛbɛwuwu, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛahunu Onyankopɔn!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23"/>Nanso, ne yere kaa sɛ, “Sɛ Awurade bɛkum yɛn a, anka wannye yɛn ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne aduane afɔdeɛ no. Anka ɔrenyi ne ho adi nkyerɛ yɛn, nka anwanwasɛm nkyerɛ yɛn, nyɛ saa anwanwadeɛ yi nso.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24"/>Ɔbaa no woo ne babarima no, wɔtoo ne din Samson. Na abɔfra no renyini no, Awurade hyiraa no. <verse eid="JDG 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25"/>Na ɛberɛ a ɔwɔ Mahane Dan a ɛwɔ Sora ne Estaol ntam no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Honhom hyɛɛ aseɛ baa ne so.<verse eid="JDG 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Samson Awadeɛ Ne Nʼaborɔme No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1"/>Dabi a na Samson wɔ Timna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Timna yɛ kuro bi a na ɛwɔ Dan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 19:43">Yos 19.43</ref></char>). Na Filistifoɔ te saa kuro yi mu ansa na Israelfoɔ rebɛfa hɔ.</char></note> no, ɔhunuu Filistini ababaawa bi. <verse eid="JDG 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2"/>Ɔsane kɔɔ efie no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼagya ne ne maame sɛ, “Mahunu Filistini ababaawa bi wɔ Timna a mepɛ sɛ meware no.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3"/>Nʼagya ne ne maame ampene so kaa no anibereɛ so sɛ, “Enti, yɛn abusua yi mu anaa Israelfoɔ yi mu, ɔbaa baako mpo nni mu a wotumi ware no? Adɛn na ɛsɛ sɛ wokɔ Filistifoɔ abosonsomfoɔ mu kɔpɛ ɔyere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Nanso, Samson ka kyerɛɛ nʼagya sɛ, “Kɔyɛ ne ho adeɛ ma me. Ɔno ara na mepɛ.” <verse eid="JDG 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4"/>Nʼagya ne ne maame anhunu sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔreyɛ nʼadwuma, repɛ akwannya bi a ɔbɛfa so atia Filistifoɔ a saa ɛberɛ no na wɔdi Israelfoɔ so.<verse eid="JDG 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5"/>Samson ne nʼawofoɔ rekɔ Timna no, gyata ba bi to hyɛɛ Samson so wɔ beaeɛ bi a ɛbɛn Timna bobe nturo. <verse eid="JDG 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6"/>Amonom hɔ ara, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Honhom baa ne so wɔ ahoɔden mu, na ɔde ne nsa hunu waee gyata no apantan. Ɔwaee te sɛ deɛ ɔrewae abirekyie ba bi apantan. Nanso, wanka deɛ ɔyɛeɛ yi ankyerɛ nʼawofoɔ. <verse eid="JDG 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7"/>Samson duruu Timna no, ɔne ɔbaa no kasaeɛ na nʼani gyee ne ho.<verse eid="JDG 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8"/>Akyire no a ɔresane akɔ Timna akɔhyia ayeforɔ no, ɔmane kɔhwɛɛ gyata no funu no. Ɔhunuu sɛ nwowa kuo akɔyɛ ɛwoɔ wɔ mu. <verse eid="JDG 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9"/>Ɔkɔtii ɛwoɔ no bi dii wɔ ɛkwan so. Ɔmaa nʼawofoɔ no bi ma wɔdiiɛ. Nanso, wanka ankyerɛ wɔn sɛ ɔnyaa ɛwoɔ no wɔ gyata funu no mu.<verse eid="JDG 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10"/>Afei, ɛberɛ a nʼagya reyɛ ahoboa ama awaregyeɛ no, Samson too ɛpono wɔ Timna, sɛdeɛ amanneɛ kyerɛ saa ɛberɛ no. <verse eid="JDG 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11"/>Wɔtoo nsa frɛɛ mmeranteɛ aduasa a wɔfiri kuro no mu sɛ wɔmmɛka ne ho. <verse eid="JDG 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12"/>Samson ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Momma menka aborɔme bi nkyerɛ mo. Sɛ nnanson apontoɔ yi mu, motumi yi ano a, mɛma mo serekyetam ntadeɛ aduasa ne ntadeɛ ahodoɔ bi nso aduasa. <verse eid="JDG 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13"/>Sɛ moantumi anyi ano nso a, mo nso mobɛma me serekyetam ntadeɛ aduasa ne ntadeɛ ahodoɔ bi nso aduasa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ka aborɔme no ma yɛntie.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14"/>Ɔkaa no sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">“Deɛ ɔdie mu na wɔnya biribi a wɔdie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:14">ɔhoɔdenfoɔ mu na ɔdɛ firi ba.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Nnansa akyi no, na wɔntumi nyii ano.<verse eid="JDG 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15"/>Ne nna ɛnan soɔ no, wɔkɔka kyerɛɛ Samson yere sɛ, “Gye aborɔme no mmuaeɛ firi wo kunu hɔ ma yɛn, anyɛ saa a, yɛbɛhye wo ne wʼagya fie ama wɔawu. Motoo nsa frɛɛ yɛn wɔ ha sɛ morebɛsisi yɛn anaa?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16"/>Enti, Samson yere de su baa ne nkyɛn bɛkaa sɛ, “Wonnɔ me. Wotan me! Woaka aborɔme bi akyerɛ me nkurɔfoɔ, nanso, wonkyerɛɛ me aseɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samson buaa ne yere no sɛ, “Saa ara na mʼagya ne me maame nso menkyerɛɛ wɔn aseɛ. Na adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ meka kyerɛ wo?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17"/>Enti, ɔsu guu ne so biribiara ɔne no wɔ hɔ. Ɔkɔɔ so saa ara nna a aka na apontoɔ no aba nʼawieeɛ nyinaa. Nnanson so no, ɛsiane ha a ɔhaa no enti, ɔkyerɛɛ no aseɛ. Ɔno nso kaa aborɔme asekyerɛ no kyerɛɛ mmeranteɛ no.<verse eid="JDG 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18"/>Na nnanson so, ansa na owia rebɛtɔ no, kuro no mu mmarima baa Samson nkyɛn bɛkyerɛɛ no aseɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ɛdeɛn na ɛyɛ dɛ sene woɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Ɛdeɛn na ɛwɔ ahoɔden sene gyata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Samson buaa wɔn sɛ, “Sɛ mo ne ɔfatwafoɔ no antu agyina, anka morennya aborɔme no asekyerɛ.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Honhom de ahoɔden kɛseɛ bi baa ne so. Ɔkɔɔ Askelon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Askelon yɛ Filistia kuro.</char></note> kuro mu. Ɔkunkumm mmarima aduasa faa wɔn agyapadeɛ nyinaa. Ɔde wɔn ntadeɛ maa mmarima a wɔyii aborɔme no ano no. Na Samson bo annwo deɛ ɛbaeɛ no ho yie enti ɔkɔɔ ne fie na ɔne nʼawofoɔ kɔtenaeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20"/>Enti, wɔde ne yere no maa ɔbarima a na ɔdi Samson nan ase wɔ wɔn ayeforɔhyia mu no awadeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Samson Aweretɔ Wɔ Filistifoɔ So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1"/>Akyire yi, ayuotwaberɛ mu no, Samson faa abirekyie ba sɛ ɔde rekɔkyɛ ne yere. Ɔpɛɛ sɛ anka ɔkɔda ne nkyɛn nanso, ɔbaa no agya amma no mu ɛkwan.<verse eid="JDG 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2"/>Ɔbaa no agya no kaa sɛ, “Medwenee sɛ na wotan no, ɛno enti, mede no ama ɔbarima a na ɔdi wʼanan ase wɔ mo ayeforɔhyia mu no. Nanso, hwɛ ne nuabaa ho yɛ fɛ sen no. Ware no si anan.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3"/>Samson kaa sɛ, “Saa ɛberɛ yi, obiara rentumi mmɔ me soboɔ wɔ biribiara a merebɛyɛ mo Filistifoɔ ho.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4"/>Afei ɔfiri hɔ kɔeɛ, kɔkyeree asakraman ahasa. Ɔkyekyeree sakraman mmienu mmienu dua bɔɔ ho. Mmienu biara nso, ɔkyekyeree ogyatɛn fam ho. <verse eid="JDG 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5"/>Ɔsɔɔ ogyatɛn no na ɔmaa asakraman no tuu mmirika faa Filistifoɔ mfuo mu. Ɔhyee wɔn ayuo nyinaa pasaa; deɛ wɔahyehyɛ no apa so ne deɛ wɔnntwaeɛ nyinaa. Ɔsɛee wɔn bobefuo ne ngo nnua nyinaa.<verse eid="JDG 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6"/>Filistifoɔ no bisaa sɛ, “Na hwan na ɔyɛɛ saa amumuyɛ yi?” Wɔn ara buaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ Samson ɛfiri sɛ, nʼase barima a ɔfiri Timna de Samson yere ama ɔbarima a na ɔdi ne nan ase wɔ wɔn ayeforɔhyia mu no awadeɛ.” Enti, Filistifoɔ kɔkyeree ɔbaa no ne nʼagya hyee wɔn ma wɔwuiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7"/>Samson suaee sɛ, “Esiane deɛ moayɛ yi enti, mɛtua mo so ka na merennyae ara da kɔsi sɛ me bo bɛtɔ me yam!” <verse eid="JDG 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8"/>Enti, ɔde abufuo kɔto hyɛɛ Filistifoɔ no so kunkumm wɔn mu bebree. Afei, ɔkɔtenaa ɔbodan bi a ɛwɔ ɔbotan bi mu wɔ Etam.<verse eid="JDG 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9"/>Filistifoɔ no nso kyeree sraban wɔ Yuda sɛee Lehi kuro no de tuaa ne so ka. <verse eid="JDG 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10"/>Yuda mmarima bisaa Filistifoɔ no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na moto hyɛ yɛn so saa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Filistifoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Yɛaba sɛ yɛrebɛkyere Samson. Deɛ ɔyɛɛ yɛn no, yɛrebɛtua no so ka.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11"/>Enti, Yudafoɔ mpensa kɔɔ ɔbodan a ɛwɔ ɔbotan mu wɔ Etam no sɛ wɔrekɔkyere Samson. Wɔka kyerɛɛ Samson sɛ, “Wonnim sɛ Filistifoɔ na wɔdi yɛn so? Ɛdeɛn na woreyɛ yɛn yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Nanso, Samson buaa wɔn sɛ, “Deɛ wɔyɛɛ me no na metuaa wɔn so ka.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12"/>Nanso, Yuda mmarima ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛaba sɛ yɛrebɛkyekyere wo na yɛde wo akɔma Filistifoɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samson kaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ, nanso, monhyɛ me bɔ sɛ mo ankasa deɛ, morenkum me.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13"/>Wɔbuaa sɛ, “Yɛbɛkyekyere wo de wo akɔma Filistifoɔ. Yɛrenkum wo.” Enti, wɔde ahoma foforɔ mmienu guu ne so kyekyeree no pampee, twee no firii ɔbotan no mu.<verse eid="JDG 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14"/>Samson duruu Lehi no, Filistifoɔ no bɔɔ ose. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Honhom tumi mu ahoɔden baa Samson so. Ɔtetee nhoma a ɛgu ne nsa so no mu te sɛ nhoma nketewa bi a ogya aka, maa ne nyinaa tete firii nʼabakɔn guu fam. <verse eid="JDG 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15"/>Afei, ɔmaa afunumu apantan bi a na ɛda fam so de kunkumm Filistifoɔ apem. <verse eid="JDG 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16"/>Na Samson kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">“Mede afunumu apantan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">Ahɔre wɔn sɛ esie!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">Mede afunumu apantan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">akunkum mmarima apem!”<verse eid="JDG 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17"/>Na ɔwiee kasa no, ɔtoo apantan no tweneeɛ. Na wɔtoo beaeɛ hɔ edin Ramat-Lehi a aseɛ ne Apantan bepɔ.<verse eid="JDG 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18"/>Ɛbaa sɛ osukɔm dee Samson yie enti ɔsu frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Wonam wʼakoa ahoɔden so adi saa nkonim kɛseɛ yi. Na enti osukɔm nku me, na mentɔ wɔ saa abosonsomfoɔ yi nsam?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19"/>Enti, Awurade maa nsuo pue firii tokuro bi mu wɔ Lehi asase so baabi. Na Samson nom bi no, ne ho sanee no. Na ɔtoo hɔ din sɛ En-Hakore, na ɛda so wɔ Lehi de bɛsi ɛnnɛ.<verse eid="JDG 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20"/>Samson yɛɛ Israel so ɔtemmufoɔ mfeɛ aduonu ɛberɛ a na Filistifoɔ di Israel asase so no.<verse eid="JDG 15:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Samson Tutu Gasa Apono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1"/>Ɛda bi, Samson kɔɔ Filistifoɔ kuropɔn Gasa mu, na ɔne ɔbaa dwamanfoɔ bi kɔdaa anadwo no. <verse eid="JDG 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2"/>Ankyɛre na kuro mma no tee sɛ Samson wɔ hɔ, enti Gasa mmarima boaboaa wɔn ho ano na wɔtwɛnee kuro no ɛpono ano anadwo mu no nyinaa. Wɔyɛɛ komm anadwo no kaa sɛ, “Adeɛ kye a yɛbɛkum no.”<verse eid="JDG 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3"/>Na Samson daa hɔ ara kɔsii dasuo mu. Ɔsɔre sɔɔ kuro no apono no ne nʼaponnwa mmienu mu hodwoo no, na ɔtutuu dadeɛ abaa a ɛda akyire ne deɛ ɛkeka ho nyinaa. Ɔde ne nyinaa guu ne mmatire so, soa de kɔɔ bepɔ bi a ɛne Hebron di nhwɛanimu no atifi.<verse eid="JDG 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samson Ne Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4"/>Akyire no, Samson nyaa ɔbaa bi wɔ Sorek bɔnhwa no mu a na wɔfrɛ no Delila. <verse eid="JDG 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5"/>Filistifoɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Filistia yɛ nkurotoɔ enum a aka abom a wɔwɔ ahemfo baanum.</char></note> ntuanofoɔ kɔɔ ɔbaa no nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Hwɛ sɛ wobɛtumi adaadaa Samson ma wakyerɛ wo deɛ ɛma ɔnya ahoɔden saa ne sɛdeɛ yɛbɛtumi adi ne so, akyekyere no pampee. Na yɛn mu biara bɛma wo nnwetɛbena kilogram dumienu ne fa.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6"/>Enti, Delila ka kyerɛɛ Samson sɛ, “Mesrɛ wo kyerɛ me deɛ ɛma wo ahoɔden saa ne deɛ ɛbɛyɛ a yɛbɛtumi akyekyere wo pampee.”<verse eid="JDG 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7"/>Samson buaa no sɛ, “Sɛ obi de agyan so nhoma nson a ɛnwoeɛ kyekyere me a, mɛyɛ mmerɛ te sɛ onipa biara.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8"/>Enti, Filistifoɔ ntuanofoɔ no de agyan so nhoma nson a ɛnwoeɛ brɛɛ Delila maa ɔde kyekyeree Samson. <verse eid="JDG 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi na ɔde mmarima atɛ wɔ adan a ɛwɔ ne fie no mu baako mu, na ɔteaam sɛ, “Samson, Filistifoɔ no aba rebɛkye wo!” Nanso, ɔtetee agyan nhoma nson a ɛnwoeɛ no mu te sɛ ahoma bi a wɔde aka ogya dɛreɛ. Enti, wɔanhunu nʼahoɔden no ahintasɛm.<verse eid="JDG 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10"/>Akyire yi, Delila ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wodii me ho fɛ, twaa me nkontompo. Afei, mesrɛ wo kyerɛ me sɛdeɛ wɔbɛtumi akyekyere wo pampee.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11"/>Samson buaa no sɛ, “Sɛ wɔde ntampehoma mono a wɔmfa nnii dwuma biara da kyekyere me a, meyɛ mmerɛ te sɛ onipa obiara.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12"/>Enti, Delila kɔfaa ntampehoma mono de kyekyeree no. Saa ɛberɛ no na mmarima no akɔtɛ wɔ dan mu te sɛ kane no. Bio, Delila teaam frɛɛ no sɛ, “Samson! Filistifoɔ aba sɛ wɔrebɛkye wo!” Nanso, Samson tetee ntampehoma no mu firii ne nsa so te sɛ asaawa bi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13"/>Delila ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wodii me ho fɛ, twaa me nkontompo! Worenkyerɛ me sɛdeɛ wɔbɛtumi akyekyere wo pampee anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samson buaa no sɛ, “Sɛ wonwono me tirinwi mmɛsa nson no bɔ ntoma bamma a ɛwɔ wʼakurokurowa no mu a, mɛyɛ mmerɛ te sɛ obiara.” Enti ɔdaeɛ no, Delila bɔɔ ne tirinwi mmɛsa nson no <verse eid="JDG 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14"/>de bɔɔ ntoma bamma a ɛwɔ akurokurowa no so.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:14">Bio, ɔteaam sɛ, “Samson! Filistifoɔ no aba rebɛkye wo!” Ɛhɔ ara, Samson nyaneeɛ, twee akurokurowa no yii ne tirinwi no firii ntoma bamma no mu.<verse eid="JDG 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15"/>Delila sɔm nʼano kaa sɛ, “Wotumi ka sɛ wodɔ me, wɔ ɛberɛ a wonka wo kokoamsɛm nkyerɛ me? Woadi me ho fɛ mprɛnsa, nanso wonkaa deɛ ɛma wo ahoɔden no nkyerɛɛ me!” <verse eid="JDG 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16"/>Odwan ne ho adekyeɛ biara kɔsii sɛ afei na wabrɛ no.<verse eid="JDG 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17"/>Ne korakora no, Samson kaa nʼahintasɛm kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wɔnyii me tirinwi da, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔde me maa Onyankopɔn sɛ Nasareni firi awoɔ mu. Sɛ wɔyi me tirinwi a, mʼahoɔden no bɛfiri me mu ama mayɛ mmerɛ te sɛ obiara.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18"/>Delila hunuu sɛ afei deɛ waka nokorɛ akyerɛ no no, ɔsoma kɔfrɛɛ Filistifoɔ ntuanofoɔ no sɛ, “Mommra bio, ɛfiri sɛ waka biribiara akyerɛ me.” Enti, Filistifoɔ ntuanofoɔ no sane wɔn akyi kɔfaa sika no baeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19"/>Delila dɛfɛdɛfɛɛ Samson ma ɔdaeɛ a, ne ti da ne srɛ so. Ɔfrɛɛ ɔbarima bi baeɛ ma ɔbɛyii ne tirinwi sɛdeɛ ne kyere no bɛyɛ yie. Na nʼahoɔden no firii ne mu. <verse eid="JDG 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20"/>Afei, ɔteaam sɛ, “Samson! Filistifoɔ no aba rebɛkye wo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:20">Ɔnyaneeɛ no, ɔkaa wɔ ne tirim sɛ, “Mɛyɛ sɛdeɛ kane no na meyɛ no mɛwoso me ho agye me ho.” Nanso na ɔnnim sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afiri ne mu.<verse eid="JDG 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21"/>Na Filistifoɔ no kyeree no, tutuu nʼani. Wɔde no kɔɔ Gasa na wɔguu no kɔbere mfrafraeɛ mpokyerɛ ma ɔyamm atokoɔ wɔ nnedua fie. <verse eid="JDG 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22"/>Nanso, ankyɛre na ne tirinwi no hyɛɛ aseɛ fuiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samson Nkonimdie A Ɛdi Akyire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23"/>Filistifoɔ ntuanofoɔ hyɛɛ fa kɛseɛ bi, bɔɔ afɔdeɛ maa wɔn nyame Dagon dii ahurisie kaa sɛ, “Yɛn nyame de Samson a ɔyɛ yɛn ɔtamfoɔ no ahyɛ yɛn nsam!”<verse eid="JDG 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa no hunuu no no, wɔkamfoo wɔn nyame kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">“Yɛn nyame de yɛn ɔtamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">ahyɛ yɛn nsam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">deɛ ɔkunkumm yɛn mu bebree no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">yɛn nsa aka no!”<verse eid="JDG 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25"/>Nnipa no boroo nsã kakra no, wɔhyɛɛ sɛ, “Momfa Samson mmra na ɔmmɛgye yɛn ani.” Enti, wɔyii Samson firii nnedua fie. Wɔde no gyinaa asɔredan no mfimfini wɔ adum mmienu a ɛkura ɛdan no mmɔsoɔ no ntam.<verse eid="JDG 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26"/>Samson ka kyerɛɛ ɔsomfoɔ a ɔkura ne nsa rekyerɛ no kwan no sɛ, “Ma memfa me nsa nsosɔ adum mmienu no mu, na mennye mʼahome.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27"/>Na nnipa ahyɛ asɔrefie hɔ ma tɔ. Filistifoɔ ntuanofoɔ no nyinaa wɔ hɔ bi. Na ɛdan no so mmɔsoɔ no nso na mmarima ne mmaa bɛyɛ mpensa wɔ so a wɔrehwɛ Samson na wɔredi ne ho fɛ.<verse eid="JDG 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28"/>Na Samson su frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Ao Otumfoɔ Awurade, kae me bio. Ao Onyankopɔn, mesrɛ wo ma me ahoɔden bio na mentua Filistifoɔ so ka wɔ mʼani a wɔatutu no so.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29"/>Afei Samson sosɔɔ adum mmienu a ɛwɔ asɔrefie no mfimfini no mu. Ɔde nʼahoɔden nyinaa piaeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30"/>Samson bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, “Ma me ne Filistifoɔ no nwu.” Na asɔrefie no dwiri guu Filistifoɔ ntuanofoɔ no ne nnipa no nyinaa so. Enti, ɔkumm nnipa bebree sene dodoɔ a ɔkumm wɔn ɛberɛ a na ɔte ase no.<verse eid="JDG 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31"/>Akyire yi, ne nuammarima ne nʼabusuafoɔ a wɔaka kɔfaa no. Wɔde no kɔɔ ne kurom kɔsiee no wɔ Sora ne Estaol ntam, baabi a wɔsiee nʼagya Manoa hɔ. Samson dii Israelfoɔ so ɔtemmufoɔ mfeɛ aduonu.<verse eid="JDG 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Mika Ahoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1"/>Ɔbarima bi tenaa Efraim bepɔ asase so a na wɔfrɛ no Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2"/>Ɛda koro bi, ɔka kyerɛɛ ne maame sɛ, “Metee sɛ wodomee ɔkorɔmfoɔ a ɔwiaa wo nnwetɛbena kilogram dumienu firii wo nkyɛn no. Ɛyɛ, ɛnie. Me ara na mefaeɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Ne maame kaa sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wo sɛ woaka nokorɛ.” <verse eid="JDG 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3"/>Ɔde sika no maa no no, ne maame no kaa sɛ, “Mede saa nnwetɛbena kilogram dumienu ne fa yi ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Mɛma wɔayɛ nsɛsodeɛ ne ohoni a wɔagu de ahyɛ me babarima animuonyam.”<verse eid="JDG 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4"/>Enti ne maame de nnwetɛbena ahanu kɔmaa dwetɛdwumfoɔ na ɔde yɛɛ nsɛsodeɛ ne ohoni. Na wɔde sii Mika fie. <verse eid="JDG 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5"/>Mika yɛɛ asɔreeɛ na ɔyɛɛ asɔfotadeɛ ne efiefoɔ ahoni kaa ho. Ɛnna ɔhyɛɛ ne mmammarima no mu baako ɔsɔfoɔ. <verse eid="JDG 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Israel nni ɔhene, enti na nnipa no yɛ deɛ wɔpɛ biara.<verse eid="JDG 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7"/>Ɛda bi, Lewini aberanteɛ bi a ɔfiri Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yuda <verse eid="JDG 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8"/>bɛduruu saa beaeɛ hɔ wɔ Efraim asase so a ɔrepɛ baabi pa atena. Ɛbaa sɛ, ɔkɔsoɛɛ Mika fie. <verse eid="JDG 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9"/>Mika bisaa no sɛ, “Ɛhe na wofiri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Ɔno nso buaa sɛ, “Meyɛ Lewini a mefiri Betlehem wɔ Yuda na merepɛ baabi matena.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10"/>Mika ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wo ne me ntena ha, na wobɛyɛ agya ne ɔsɔfoɔ ama me. Mɛma wo nnwetɛbena gram ɔha ne dunan (114) afe biara; mɛma wo ntadeɛ ne aduane.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11"/>Lewini no penee so na ɔbɛyɛɛ sɛ Mika mmammarima no mu baako. <verse eid="JDG 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12"/>Enti, Mika hyɛɛ Lewini no ɔsɔfoɔ, na ɔtenaa Mika fie. <verse eid="JDG 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13"/>Na Mika kaa sɛ, “Menim sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛhyira me, ɛfiri sɛ, mewɔ Lewini a ɔresom sɛ me ɔsɔfoɔ.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Dan Abusuakuo Mu Ahonisom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1"/>Saa ɛberɛ no mu na Israel nni ɔhene. Na Dan abusuakuo rehwehwɛ baabi atena, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔntumi mpamoo nnipa a wɔte asase a wɔde maa wɔn no so. <verse eid="JDG 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2"/>Enti, mmarima a wɔfiri Dan abusuakuo yii akofoɔ enum a na wɔte Sora ne Estaol sɛ wɔnkɔpɛ asase a wɔbɛtumi atena so.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:2">Ɛberɛ a saa akofoɔ yi duruu Efraim bepɔ asase so no, wɔkɔɔ Mika fie kɔdaa hɔ anadwo no. <verse eid="JDG 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3"/>Wɔtiee Lewini aberanteɛ no sɛdeɛ ɔkasa no, wɔde no kɔɔ nkyɛn bisaa no sɛ, “Hwan na ɔde wo baa ha na ɛdeɛn na woreyɛ? Na adɛn enti na wowɔ ha?” <verse eid="JDG 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4"/>Ɔkaa nhyehyɛeɛ a ɔne Mika ayɛ kyerɛɛ wɔn na ɔkyerɛɛ mu sɛ, ɔyɛ ɔsɔfoɔ ma Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5"/>Na wɔkaa sɛ, “Bisa Awurade ma yɛn sɛ yɛn akwantuo yi bɛsi yie anaasɛ ɛrensi yie.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6"/>Ɔsɔfoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Monkɔ no asomdwoeɛ mu, ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade bɛdi mo anim wɔ mo akwantuo no mu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7"/>Na mmarima baanum no kɔɔ kuro bi a wɔfrɛ no Lais mu. Wɔhunuu sɛ nnipa a hwee mfa wɔn ho te sɛ Sidonfoɔ na ɛte hɔ. Na wɔwɔ asomdwoeɛ ne banbɔ. Na nnipa no wɔ sika, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔn asase no yɛ asase bereɛ. Na wɔne Sidon ntam twe yie, na wɔnni adɔmfoɔ a wɔbɛn.<verse eid="JDG 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔsane kɔɔ Sora ne Estaol no, wɔn nuanom bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na mohunuiɛ?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9"/>Na wɔbuaa sɛ, “Momma yɛnkɔto nhyɛ wɔn so! Yɛahunu asase no na ɛyɛ pa ara. Monntwentwɛn mo nan ase koraa, monkɔfa asase no. <verse eid="JDG 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10"/>Sɛ moduru hɔ a, mobɛhunu nnipa a hwee mfa wɔn ho wɔ hɔ. Onyankopɔn ama yɛn asase bereɛ yantamm a biribiara wɔ so.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11"/>Enti, akofoɔ ahansia a wɔfiri Dan abusuakuo mu sii mu firii Sora ne Estaol. <verse eid="JDG 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12"/>Wɔkyeree nsraban wɔ beaeɛ bi a ɛwɔ Kiriat-Yearim atɔeɛ fam wɔ Yuda asase so. Wɔfrɛ hɔ Mahane Dan bɛsi ɛnnɛ. <verse eid="JDG 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13"/>Wɔfiri hɔ no, wɔkɔɔ Efraim bepɔ asase no so, baa Mika fie.<verse eid="JDG 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14"/>Enti, mmarima baanum a wɔkɔsraa Lais asase no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a aka no sɛ, “Asɔreeɛ bi wɔ ha a asɔfotadeɛ kronkron, abusua ahoni, nsɛsodeɛ a wɔasene ne ohoni a wɔagu ho wɔ hɔ. Monim deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15"/>Enti, mmarima baanum no kɔɔ Mika fie, baabi a Lewini aberanteɛ no teɛ na wɔkyeaa no fɛ so. <verse eid="JDG 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na akofoɔ ahansia a wɔfiri Dan abusuakuo mu no gyinagyina abɔntenpono no ano pɛɛ, <verse eid="JDG 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17"/>na akwansrafoɔ baanum no kɔɔ asɔreeɛ hɔ, kɔfaa nsɛsodeɛ a wɔasene, asɔfotadeɛ kronkron, abusua ahoni ne ohoni a wɔagu no.<verse eid="JDG 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔsɔfoɔ no hunuu sɛ mmarima no retwe akronkronneɛ no afiri Mika asɔreeɛ hɔ no, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na moreyɛ yi?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19"/>Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Mua wʼano! Di yɛn akyi na bɛyɛ yɛn nyinaa agya ne yɛn ɔsɔfoɔ. Wonnye nni sɛ ɛyɛ sɛ wobɛyɛ Israel abusuakuo bi ɔsɔfoɔ sene sɛ wobɛyɛ onipa baako fidua mu ɔsɔfoɔ?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20"/>Ɔsɔfoɔ aberanteɛ no ani gyeeɛ sɛ ɔne wɔn bɛkɔ. Enti ɔfaa asɔfotadeɛ kronkron no, abusua ahoni ne nsɛsodeɛ a wɔasene no. <verse eid="JDG 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21"/>Wɔsiim bio de wɔn mma, nyɛmmoa ne wɔn agyapadeɛ, dii wɔn anim.<verse eid="JDG 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22"/>Ɛberɛ a Dan abusuakuo mu nnipa no afiri Mika fie kɔ akyirikyiri no, Mika ne nʼafipamfoɔ mu bi tii wɔn. <verse eid="JDG 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23"/>Wɔbɛn wɔn no wɔteateaam. Na Dan mmarima no danee wɔn ani kaa sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na morehwehwɛ? Adɛn enti na woafrɛ nnipa yi aboa ano na moretaa yɛn sei?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24"/>Mika buaa sɛ, “Wobisa sɛ ɛdeɛn na worehwehwɛ a na wokyerɛ sɛn? Moafa mʼanyame nyinaa ne me ɔsɔfoɔ, na menni hwee bio!”<verse eid="JDG 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25"/>Dan mmarima no buaa sɛ, “Hwɛ deɛ woka no yie! Yɛn mu bi bo nkyɛre fu, anhwɛ a wɔn bo bɛfu na wɔakum wo ne wʼabusuafoɔ.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26"/>Enti, Dan mmarima no toaa so kɔɔ wɔn kwan. Mika hunuu sɛ nnipa no dɔɔso a enti ɔntumi nto nhyɛ wɔn so no, ɔdanee ne ho kɔɔ efie.<verse eid="JDG 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27"/>Dan mmarima faa Mika ahoni ne ne ɔsɔfoɔ no de wɔn baa kuro Lais a emu nnipa wɔ asomdwoeɛ ne banbɔ no mu. Wɔto hyɛɛ emu nnipa no so, kunkumm wɔn nyinaa, hyee kuro no dworobɛɛ. <verse eid="JDG 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28"/>Na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛgye kuro no mufoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, na deɛ wɔte no ne Sidon mu twe na wɔnni adɔmfoɔ a wɔbɛn nso. Saa asɛm yi sii bɔnhwa a ɛbɛn Bet-Rehob no mu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:28">Afei, Dan abusuakuo no mma sane kyekyeree kuro no, na wɔtenaa hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29"/>Wɔde kuro no too Dan a ɔyɛ wɔn tete agya Israel no ba, na kane no wɔfrɛ hɔ Lais.<verse eid="JDG 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30"/>Afei, wɔgyinaa nsɛsodeɛ a wɔasene no na wɔfaa Gersom babarima Yonatan a ɔyɛ Manase aseni sɛ wɔn ɔsɔfoɔ. Saa fie yi mu nnipa kɔɔ so yɛɛ asɔfoɔ maa Dan abusuakuo kɔsii Otukorɔ berɛ. <verse eid="JDG 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31"/>Enti Dan abusuakuo no toaa so somm nsɛsodeɛ a ɛyɛ Mika dea no wɔ ɛberɛ tenten a na Onyankopɔn Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no wɔ Silo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Lewini Ne Ne Mpena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Israel nni ɔhene. Na ɔbarima bi a ɔfiri Lewi abusuakuo mu te Efraim bepɔ asase no so akyirikyiri baabi. Ɛda bi, ɔde ɔbaa bi firi Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yuda baa fie sɛ ne mpena. <verse eid="JDG 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2"/>Nanso, ɔbaa no anni no nokorɛ enti ɔsane kɔɔ nʼagya fie wɔ Betlehem. Abosome ɛnan akyi, <verse eid="JDG 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3"/>ne kunu no faa ɔsomfoɔ ne afunumu foforɔ kaa ne ho kɔɔ Betlehem sɛ ɔde rekɔkorɔkorɔ no na wasane nʼakyi aba. Ɔduruu ɔbaa no agya fie no, ɔde no kɔɔ efie no mu maa nʼagya no gyee no fɛ so. <verse eid="JDG 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4"/>Ɔbaa no agya ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔntena nkyɛ kakra. Enti, ɔdii nnansa, didiiɛ, nomeeɛ, daa hɔ.<verse eid="JDG 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5"/>Ne nna ɛnan so no, ɔbarima no sɔree anɔpa, pɛɛ sɛ ɔkɔ. Nanso, ɔbaa no agya ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Didi ansa na woakɔ.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6"/>Enti, wɔn baanu no tenaa ase didiiɛ, nomeeɛ. Afei, ɔbaa no agya ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Mesrɛ wo, da anadwo yi na gye wʼani.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7"/>Ɔbarima no sɔree sɛ anka ɔrekɔ, nanso, nʼase no hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔntena. Enti, ɔpenee so daa hɔ anadwo no. <verse eid="JDG 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8"/>Nnanum so anɔpa no, ɔsɔree bio a ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔkɔ. Nanso, bio, ɔbaa no agya kaa sɛ, “Didi ansa, na awiam kakra no wobɛtumi akɔ.” Enti, wɔsane didii bio.<verse eid="JDG 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9"/>Awia no, ɔbarima no ne ne mpena no ne ne ɔsomfoɔ boaboaa wɔn ho pɛɛ sɛ wɔkɔ. Nanso, nʼase no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Montie! Adeɛ reyɛ asa. Montena na monnye mo ani anadwo yi. Ɔkyena mobɛtumi asim anɔpahema.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10"/>Nanso, afei deɛ ɔbarima no pɛɛ sɛ ɔbɛkɔ. Enti ɔfaa ne mfunumu mmienu a wɔahyehyɛ wɔn no ne mpena no, na wɔde wɔn ani kyerɛɛ Yebus (a ɛyɛ Yerusalem). <verse eid="JDG 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔduruu Yebus no na adeɛ reyɛ asa, na ɔsomfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ ne wura no sɛ, “Adeɛ reyɛ asa, enti momma yɛnna Yebusifoɔ kuropɔn yi mu anadwo yi.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12"/>Ne wura no buaa sɛ, “Dabi, yɛrentumi ntena ananafoɔ kuropɔn a Israelfoɔ nni mu yi mu. Yɛbɛtoa so akɔ Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13"/>Yɛbɛnya daberɛ anadwo yi wɔ Gibea anaa Rama.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14"/>Enti, wɔtoaa so. Wɔrebɛduru kuro Gibea a ɛwɔ Benyamin asase so no, na owia rekɔtɔ, <verse eid="JDG 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15"/>Enti wɔdaa hɔ anadwo no. Wɔdaa kuro no abɔntene kɛseɛ so, na obiara amfa wɔn ankɔ fie ankɔsom wɔn hɔhoɔ.<verse eid="JDG 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16"/>Anwummerɛ no, akɔkoraa bi firii nʼafuom baa fie. Na ɔfiri Efraim bepɔ asase so, nanso na ɔte Gibea wɔ Benyamin asase so. <verse eid="JDG 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔhunuu akwantufoɔ yi sɛ wɔtete kuro no abɔntene kɛseɛ so no, ɔbisaa wɔn baabi a wɔfiri ne baabi a wɔrekorɔ.<verse eid="JDG 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18"/>Ɔbarima no buaa no sɛ, “Yɛfiri Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yudea na yɛrekɔ Efraim bepɔ asase no so kuro bi a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri, na yɛrekɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Asɔrefie. Nanso obiara amfa yɛn ankɔ ne fie ankɔpɛ yɛn daberɛ, <verse eid="JDG 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19"/>ɛwom sɛ yɛwɔ deɛ ɛhia yɛn biara. Yɛwɔ ɛserɛ ne aduane a yɛde bɛma yɛn mfunumu; yɛwɔ burodo ne nsã.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20"/>Akɔkoraa no kaa sɛ, “Mommra mmɛsoɛ me. Mɛma mo biribiara a ɛbɛhia mo. Na mmom, anadwo yi deɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ moda abɔntene kɛseɛ so hɔ.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21"/>Enti, ɔfaa wɔn de wɔn kɔɔ ne fie, na ɔmaa wɔn mfunumu no aduane. Wɔhohoroo wɔn nan ase wieeɛ no, wɔbɔɔ mu didiiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔregye wɔn ani no, kuro no mu nnipa bɔnefoɔ bi bɛtwaa fie no ho hyiaeɛ. Wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ pempem ɛpono no teateaam guu akɔkoraa no so sɛ, “Fa ɔbarima a wabɛsoɛ wo no ma yɛn sɛdeɛ yɛbɛtumi ne no ada.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23"/>Akɔkoraa no firi baeɛ, bɛkasa kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Dabi, anuanom, monnyɛ bɔne a ɛte saa. Saa ɔbarima yi yɛ me hɔhoɔ na sɛ moyɛ saa a, ɛbɛyɛ animguaseɛ. <verse eid="JDG 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24"/>Me babaa ɔbaabunu ne ɔbarima yi mpena nie. Mede wɔn bɛma mo. Na deɛ mopɛ biara no monyɛ wɔn. Na mo ne saa ɔbarima yi nyɛ saa animguasedeɛ yi.”<verse eid="JDG 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25"/>Nanso, wɔantie no. Enti, Lewini no faa ne mpena no piaa no firii adi. Na kuro no mu mmarima no faa no nnidisoɔ nnidisoɔ kɔsii adekyeeɛ. Ahemadakye no na wɔgyaa no ma ɔkɔeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26"/>Ɔbaa no kɔduruu fie a ne kunu no te mu no ɛpono ano ara pɛ na ɔtɔɔ mum. Ɔdaa hɔ ara kɔsii sɛ anim teteeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27"/>Ɛberɛ a ne kunu buee ɛpono sɛ ɔrepue pɛ na ɔhunuu sɛ ɔda hɔ. Na nʼanim butu hɔ a ne nsa gu aponnwa no so. <verse eid="JDG 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28"/>Ɔhunuu no no, ɔkaa sɛ, “Sɔre! Ma yɛnkɔ!” Nanso, wammua. Enti, ɔde no too nʼafunumu no so de no kɔɔ efie.<verse eid="JDG 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29"/>Ɔduruu fie no, ɔtwee sekan de twitwaa ne mpena no mu asinasini dumienu. Na ɔde esini baako biara kɔɔ Israel mmusuakuo dumienu no mu. <verse eid="JDG 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30"/>Na obiara a ɔhunuu saa aninyanneɛ yi kaa sɛ, “Ɛfiri ɛberɛ a Israel firii Misraim no, obi nnii saa amumuyɛsɛm yi bi da. Adɛn enti na ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛkasa na yɛyɛ ho biribi?”<verse eid="JDG 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Israelfoɔ Tu Benyaminfoɔ So Sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1"/>Afei, Israelfoɔ nyinaa; ɛfiri Dan kɔsi Beer-Seba ne Gilead asase so bɛhyiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim sɛ nnipa baako wɔ Mispa. <verse eid="JDG 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2"/>Nnipa no nyinaa ne Israel mmusuakuo no nyinaa ntuanofoɔ, akofoɔ mpem ahanan a wɔkurakura akofena kɔɔ Onyankopɔn mma dwabɔ no ase. <verse eid="JDG 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3"/>(Nkra duruu Benyamin asase so sɛ Israelfoɔ mmusuakuo a wɔaka no kɔ Mispa.) Israelfoɔ no bisaa deɛ ɛyɛeɛ a saa awudisɛm yi siiɛ.<verse eid="JDG 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4"/>Enti, Lewini a ɔyɛ ɔbaa a wɔkumm no no kunu no kaa sɛ, “Me ne me mpena baa Gilead a ɛwɔ Benyamin asase so bɛdaa hɔ. <verse eid="JDG 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5"/>Anadwo no Gilead ntuanofoɔ no mu bi bɛtwaa fie no ho hyiaeɛ, pɛɛ sɛ wɔkum me, na wɔtoo me mpena no monnaa ma ɔwuiɛ. <verse eid="JDG 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6"/>Mefaa me mpena no twitwaa no asinasini de esini baako biara kɔɔ Israel mantam biara so. Ɛfiri sɛ, saa mmarima yi ayɛ atantansɛm ne aniwusɛm wɔ Israel. <verse eid="JDG 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7"/>Enti, seesei, ɛsɛ sɛ Israelfoɔ nyinaa fa adwene wɔ yei ho.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8"/>Nnipa no nyinaa sɔre buaa sɛ, “Yɛn mu biara rensane nkɔ fie. <verse eid="JDG 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9"/>Mmom, yɛbɛbɔ ntonto na yɛahunu wɔn a wɔbɛkɔ akɔto ahyɛ Gibea so. <verse eid="JDG 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10"/>Abusuakuo biara mu mmarima nkyɛmu edu mu baako na wɔbɛyi wɔn ama wɔama yɛn akofoɔ no nnuane, na yɛn a yɛaka no nso atɔ Geba so wereɛ wɔ animguasedeɛ a wɔayɛ wɔ Israel no.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11"/>Enti, Israelfoɔ nyinaa ano kɔɔ bɛnkorɔ mu boaa wɔn ho ano sɛ wɔbɛkɔ akɔto ahyɛ kuro no so.<verse eid="JDG 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12"/>Israelfoɔ no somaa abɔfoɔ kɔɔ Benyamin abusuakuo no mu kɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn awurukasɛm na moayɛ wɔ mo mu yi? <verse eid="JDG 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13"/>Monyi saa amumuyɛfoɔ a wɔfiri Gibea no mmra, na yɛnkum wɔn na yɛntu saa awurukasɛm yi ase mfiri Israel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:13">Nanso, Benyaminfoɔ no antie. <verse eid="JDG 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14"/>Mmom, wɔfifiri wɔn nkuro mu boaa wɔn ho ano wɔ Gibea sɛ wɔne Israelfoɔ no rebɛko. <verse eid="JDG 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15"/>Akofoɔ mpem aduonu nsia a wɔkurakura akofena kɔduruu Gibea, kɔkaa akofoɔ ahanson a na wɔte hɔ dada no ho. <verse eid="JDG 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16"/>Na Benyamin akofoɔ no mu ahanson yɛ abenkumma a wɔn mu biara yɛ toamfom wɔ ahwimmoɔ toɔ mu. <verse eid="JDG 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17"/>Na Israelfoɔ wɔ akofoɔ mpem ahanan a wɔkurakura akofena a Benyamin akofoɔ nka ho.<verse eid="JDG 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18"/>Ansa na wɔrebɛfiri ɔko no ase no, Israelfoɔ no kɔɔ Bet-El kɔbisaa Onyankopɔn sɛ, “Abusuakuo bɛn na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdi ɔko no anim tia Benyaminfoɔ no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa sɛ, “Yuda na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdi animu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19"/>Enti, Israelfoɔ no siim anɔpahema kɔkyeree sraban wɔ baabi a ɛbɛn Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20"/>Afei, wɔtu teneeɛ de wɔn ani kyerɛɛ Gibea sɛ wɔrekɔto ahyɛ Benyamin mmarima no so. <verse eid="JDG 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21"/>Nanso, Benyamin akofoɔ a na wɔrebɔ kuro no ho ban no pue kunkumm Israelfoɔ no ɔpeduonu mmienu wɔ akono hɔ ɛda no ara.<verse eid="JDG 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22"/>Nanso, Israelfoɔ nyaa akokoɔduru boaa wɔn ho ano wɔ baabi a wɔkoo ɛda a ɛdi animu no. <verse eid="JDG 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23"/>Na wɔakɔ Bet-El akɔsu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim akɔsi anwummerɛ. Afei, wɔbisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Yɛne yɛn ara abusuafoɔ a wɔfiri Benyamin nko bio anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa sɛ, “Monkɔ na mo ne wɔn nkɔko.”<verse eid="JDG 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24"/>Enti, wɔkɔko tiaa Benyamin akofoɔ no, <verse eid="JDG 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25"/>na Benyamin mmarima no sane kumm Israelfoɔ akofoɔ a wɔnim akofena akodie yie no mpem dunwɔtwe.<verse eid="JDG 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26"/>Ɛnna Israelfoɔ no kɔɔ Bet-El kɔsuu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim kyenee kɔm kɔsii anwummerɛ. Wɔbɔɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne aduane afɔdeɛ maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="JDG 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27"/>Na Israelfoɔ kɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim kɔpɛɛ akwankyerɛ. (Saa ɛberɛ no na Onyankopɔn apam adaka no wɔ Bet-El, <verse eid="JDG 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28"/>na Eleasa babarima Pinehas a ɔyɛ Aaron nana no na na ɔyɛ ɔsɔfoɔ). Israelfoɔ no bisaa Awurade, sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛko tia yɛn ara yɛn abusuafoɔ Benyamin bio anaasɛ yɛnnyae?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa sɛ, “Monkɔ! Ɔkyena mɛma moadi wɔn so nkonim.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29"/>Enti, Israelfoɔ de atɛfoɔ twaa Gibea ho nyinaa hyiaeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30"/>Ne nnansa so no, wɔboaa wɔn ho ano wɔ beaeɛ korɔ hɔ ara. <verse eid="JDG 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31"/>Ɛberɛ a Benyaminfoɔ akofoɔ pue baeɛ wɔ ɔko so no, wɔtwee wɔn firii kuro no mu. Na sɛdeɛ na wɔayɛ pɛn no, wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ kunkumm Israelfoɔ no. Ɛbɛyɛ Israelfoɔ aduasa na wɔwuwuiɛ wɔ akono petee mu hɔ a ebi deda akwan a ɛkɔ Bet-El ne Gibea ho. <verse eid="JDG 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32"/>Afei Benyamin akofoɔ no teaam sɛ, “Yɛredi wɔn so sɛdeɛ yɛdii wɔn so wɔ ɔko a ɛdi ɛkan no mu no!” Na saa ɛberɛ no na Israelfoɔ no apene so dada sɛ wɔbɛdwane ama Benyamin mmarima no ataa wɔn wɔ akwan no so, na ama wɔatwe wɔn afiri kuro no mu.<verse eid="JDG 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33"/>Ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ akodɔm kɛseɛ no duruu Baal-Tamar no, wɔdanee wɔn ho koeɛ. Ɛhɔ na Israelfoɔ a wɔatɛ wɔ Geba no puee prɛko pɛ firi wɔn atɛeɛm <verse eid="JDG 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34"/>kɔsii Benyaminfoɔ no akyi tohyɛɛ wɔn so. Ɔko no mu yɛɛ den ara kɔsii sɛ na Benyaminfoɔ no ntumi nhunu amanehunu a ɛbɛba. <verse eid="JDG 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35"/>Ɛno enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> boaa Israel ma wɔdii Benyamin so nkonim. Saa ɛda no, Israelfoɔ kunkumm Benyamin akofoɔ no mpem aduonu enum ne ɔha, a na wɔn nyinaa nim akofena ano ko yie. <verse eid="JDG 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36"/>Afei, Benyaminfoɔ no hunuu sɛ wɔadi nkoguo. Israelfoɔ no dwane firii Benyamin akofoɔ no anim, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔn a wɔakɔ atɛ no bɛnya ɛkwan ayɛ wɔn adwuma. <verse eid="JDG 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37"/>Afei, wɔn a na wɔatɛ no firii afanan nyinaa kɔɔ Gibea, kunkumm obiara a ɔwɔ kuro no mu. <verse eid="JDG 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38"/>Wɔtuee wisie kumɔnn wɔ kuro no so, <verse eid="JDG 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39"/>a ɛyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ma Israelfoɔ no sɛ wɔnsane mmra mmɛto nhyɛ Benyamin akofoɔ no so.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:39">Saa ɛberɛ no na Benyamin akofoɔ no akum Israelfoɔ no aduasa, a wɔteaam sɛ, “Yɛredi wɔn so sɛdeɛ yɛdii wɔn so ɔko a ɛdi ɛkan no mu no!” <verse eid="JDG 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a Benyamin akofoɔ no hwɛɛ wɔn akyi, na wɔhunuu wisie a atu nam ewiem wɔ kuro no mu baabiara no, <verse eid="JDG 20:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41"/>Israelfoɔ no sane baeɛ bɛto hyɛɛ wɔn so. Afei, Benyamin akofoɔ no hunuu sɛ asɛm aba na wɔbɔɔ huboa. <verse eid="JDG 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42"/>Enti, wɔdwane de wɔn ani kyerɛɛ ɛserɛ so. Nanso, Israelfoɔ no taa wɔn kunkumm wɔn. <verse eid="JDG 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43"/>Israelfoɔ no twaa Benyaminfoɔ no ho hyiaeɛ, taa wɔn anibereɛ so, kɔtoo wɔn wɔ Gibea atɔeɛ fam. <verse eid="JDG 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44"/>Ɛda no, Benyamin akofoɔ akɛseɛ mpem dunwɔtwe na wɔtotɔɔ ɔko no mu. <verse eid="JDG 20:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45"/>Wɔn a wɔanwuwu no dwane kɔɔ ɛserɛ so baabi a ɛbɛn Rimon botan no ho. Nanso, Israelfoɔ no kunkumm wɔn mu mpem enum wɔ ɛkwan no so. Wɔtoaa so taa wɔn, kɔsii sɛ wɔkumm mpenu wɔ baabi a ɛbɛn Gidom kaa ho.<verse eid="JDG 20:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46"/>Enti, Benyamin abusuakuo no hweree akofoɔ akokoɔdurufoɔ ɔpeduonunum saa ɛda no, <verse eid="JDG 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47"/>ma ɛkaa mmarima ahansia pɛ a wɔdwane kɔɔ ɔbotan Rimon ho kɔtenaa hɔ abosome ɛnan no. <verse eid="JDG 20:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48"/>Afei Israelfoɔ no sane baeɛ bɛkunkumm abɔdeɛ biara a nkwa wɔ mu wɔ nkuro no nyinaa mu, firi nnipa so kɔsi anantwie ne biribiara so. Na kuro biara a wɔduruu so no, wɔhyee no dworobɛɛ.<verse eid="JDG 20:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Benyaminfoɔ Yerenom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1"/>Israelfoɔ aka ntam wɔ Mispa sɛ, wɔremfa wɔn mmammaa mma ɔbarima biara a ɔfiri Benyamin abusuakuo mu awadeɛ.<verse eid="JDG 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2"/>Nnipa no kɔɔ Bet-El kɔtenaa Onyankopɔn anim kɔsii anwummerɛ, maa wɔn nne so, suu dendeenden kaa sɛ, <verse eid="JDG 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3"/>“Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, adɛn enti na saa asɛm yi asi? Seesei yɛn mmusuakuo no mu baako ayera!”<verse eid="JDG 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4"/>Adekyeɛ mu no, nnipa no tuaa nhema sii afɔrebukyia, na wɔbɔɔ ɔhyeɛ ne asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ. <verse eid="JDG 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5"/>Wɔbisaa sɛ, “Abusuakuo bi wɔ hɔ a wannya ɔnanmusini ɛberɛ a yɛkɔɔ nhyiamu kɛseɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim wɔ Mispa no anaa?” Saa ɛberɛ no, na wɔaka ntankɛseɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim sɛ, obiara a wamma no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔwu.<verse eid="JDG 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6"/>Na Israelfoɔ no dii yea wɔ Benyaminfoɔ no ho kaa sɛ, “Ɛnnɛ yi, abusuakuo baako afiri yɛn mu; na nʼase reyɛ atɔre. <verse eid="JDG 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7"/>Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yɛanya yerenom ama wɔn a wɔaka no, ɛsiane sɛ, yɛaka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntam sɛ yɛremfa yɛn mmammaa mu biara mma wɔn awadeɛ?”<verse eid="JDG 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8"/>Enti wɔbisaa sɛ, “Ɛberɛ a yɛde yɛn ho kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ Mispa no na obi nni hɔ bi anaa?” Ɛhɔ na wɔhunuu sɛ, obiara amfiri Yabes Gilead amma saa badwa no mu bi. <verse eid="JDG 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9"/>Na wɔkan nnipa no nyinaa no, wɔannya obiara a ɔfiri Yabes Gilead. <verse eid="JDG 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10"/>Enti, wɔsomaa akofoɔ mpem dumienu kɔɔ Yabes Gilead sɛ wɔnkɔkunkum obiara a ɔwɔ hɔ a mmaa ne mmɔfra ka ho. <verse eid="JDG 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “Yei na ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ. Monkum ɔbarima ne ɔbaa biara a ɔnyɛ ɔbaabunu.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12"/>Yabes Gileadfoɔ mu no, wɔhunuu mmaabunu ahanan a wɔne mmarima nnaa da, na wɔde wɔn baa nsraban a ɛwɔ Silo wɔ Kanaan asase so hɔ.<verse eid="JDG 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13"/>Na Israelfoɔ badwa no somaa asomdwoeɛ abɔfoɔ ma wɔkɔɔ Benyaminfoɔ nkaeɛ no a na wɔte Rimon botan ho no nkyɛn. <verse eid="JDG 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14"/>Na Benyaminfoɔ no sane kɔɔ wɔn afie mu, na wɔde mmaabunu a wɔfiri Yabes Gilead a wɔankum bi no maa wɔn awadeɛ. Nanso, mmaa no anso wɔn so.<verse eid="JDG 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15"/>Nnipa no dii Benyaminfoɔ no ho yea, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama mpaapaemu aba Israel mmusuakuo no mu. <verse eid="JDG 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16"/>Enti, Israel ntuanofoɔ no bisaa sɛ, “Sɛ wɔatɔre mmaa a wɔfiri Benyamin ase yi, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yɛanya yerenom ama mmarima a aka no? <verse eid="JDG 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ Benyaminfoɔ a aka no nya adedifoɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, Israel abusuakuo bi ase ntɔre. <verse eid="JDG 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18"/>Nanso yɛrentumi mfa yɛn mmammaa mma wɔn awadeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛaka ntankɛseɛ sɛ, obiara a ɔde ne babaa bɛma Benyaminni awadeɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nnome mmra ne so.” <verse eid="JDG 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19"/>Afei wɔdwenee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afeafe afahyɛ no ho, deɛ wɔdi wɔ Silo, a ɛwɔ Lebona ne Bet-El ntam, wɔ ɛkwan a ɛfiri Bet-El kɔsi Sekem no apueeɛ fam.<verse eid="JDG 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20"/>Na wɔka kyerɛɛ Benyamin mmarima a wɔda so hwehwɛ yerenom no sɛ, “Monkɔtɛ wɔ bobe nturo no mu. <verse eid="JDG 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21"/>Sɛ mmaa a wɔfiri Silo no ba bɛsa wɔn asa no a, mompue mfiri bobe nturo no mu, na mo mu biara bɛtumi afa wɔn mu baako de no akɔ efie sɛ ne yere. <verse eid="JDG 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22"/>Na sɛ wɔn agyanom ne wɔn nuanom mmarima ba sɛ wɔmpene so a, yɛbɛka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Yɛsrɛ mo, monte aseɛ. Momma wɔmfa mo mmammaa no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ a yɛkunkumm Yabes Gileadfoɔ no, yɛannya mmaa a ɛbɛso wɔn nyinaa so amma wɔn. Monnni ntam no ho fɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnyɛ mo na mode mo mmammaa maa wɔn awadeɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23"/>Enti, Benyamin mmarima no yɛɛ sɛdeɛ wɔkyerɛɛ wɔn no. Wɔwiawiaa mmaa a wɔbaa afahyɛ no ase, de wɔn kɔɔ asase a ɛyɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ no so. Na wɔkyekyeree wɔn nkuro no bio tenaa mu. <verse eid="JDG 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24"/>Na Israelfoɔ mmusuakuo ne mmusua no firii hɔ sane kɔɔ wɔn ankasa afie mu.<verse eid="JDG 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Israel nni ɔhene, enti na deɛ nnipa no gye di sɛ ɛyɛ wɔ wɔn ani so no na wɔyɛ.<verse eid="JDG 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21"/>
</usx>
